       & " unchanged: rules are tried in order at every position, and tokens are emitt"
       & "ed as <code>&lt;span class=""yace-tok yace-tok--&lt;type&gt;""&gt;</code> elem"
       & "ents with no built-in colours.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The highlighter is adapted from ESM/TypeScript to a single plain-script b"
       & "inding that exposes <code>window.YaceTok</code>, so the dashboard can use it"
