       & "uns ahead of the built-in string rule so object keys colour differently from"
       & " string values. The MIT licence text is preserved in the header comment of <"
       & "code>resources/yace.js</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><a href=""https://chartscss.org/"">Charts.css</a> is <strong>not</strong> b"
