       & "ith plain CSS and SVG and driven by the theme"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s CSS variables. Charts.css is credited for inspiration, and its MIT licence"
       & " terms are acknowledged here.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""development-and-testing-tools""><a class=""header"" href=""#development-"
