       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Returns:</strong> Hex digest of all patch file contents ("
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " when none).</p>"
