       & ASCII.LF
       & "this.  The tool targets Linux and WSL.  The default install root is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "$XDG_DATA_HOME/man or ~/.local/share/man.  The database updates with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>mandb</code> when it is present.</p>"
