       & "                    <main>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                        <h1 id=""spark-assurance-levels""><a class=""header"" hr"
       & "ef=""#spark-assurance-levels"">SPARK Assurance Levels</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>SPARK defines five assurance levels "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " Stone, Bronze, Silver, Gold, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Platinum "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " each building on the previous. Higher levels provide stronger"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "guarantees about absence of run-time errors and compliance with functional"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "specifications.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""level-objectives""><a class=""header"" href=""#level-objectives"">Level O"
       & "bjectives</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""stone""><a class=""header"" href=""#stone"">Stone</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>Criterion</th><th>Requirement</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Valid SPARK subset</td><td>All source code uses SPARK-compatible con"
       & "structs</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>No restricted constructs</td><td>No goto, no anonymous access types,"
       & " no uncontrolled pointers</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Enforcement</td><td><code>gnatprove</code> runs without compilation "
       & "errors</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""bronze""><a class=""header"" href=""#bronze"">Bronze</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>Criterion</th><th>Requirement</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Data-flow analysis</td><td>Every variable is assigned before use, no"
       & " uninitialized reads</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Information-flow analysis</td><td>Depends/Global contracts match act"
       & "ual data dependencies</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Initialization checks</td><td>All objects initialized before first u"
       & "se</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Enforcement</td><td><code>gnatprove --mode=flow</code> passes with 0"
       & " flow/initialization errors</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""silver""><a class=""header"" href=""#silver"">Silver</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>Criterion</th><th>Requirement</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Absence of run-time errors (AoRTE)</td><td>All run-time checks prove"
       & "d: index bounds, overflow, division-by-zero, etc.</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Assertions proved</td><td>All user-specified <code>pragma Assert</co"
       & "de> and pre/postcondition checks discharged</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Enforcement</td><td><code>gnatprove --mode=check</code> reports 0 un"
       & "proved run-time checks</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Justification</td><td>Unproved checks may be justified with <code>pr"
       & "agma Annotate</code> (limited to false positives)</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""gold""><a class=""header"" href=""#gold"">Gold</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>Criterion</th><th>Requirement</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Functional correctness</td><td>Key subprogram contracts proved: Pre/"
       & "Post, Type_Invariant</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Core invariants</td><td>Critical type/system properties specified an"
       & "d verified</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Enforcement</td><td><code>gnatprove --mode=prove</code> reports 0 un"
       & "proved functional contracts</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Coverage</td><td>At minimum: all public subprograms in core packages"
       & " have postconditions</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""platinum""><a class=""header"" href=""#platinum"">Platinum</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>Criterion</th><th>Requirement</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Full functional requirements</td><td>Complete formal specification o"
       & "f all subprogram behaviour</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Total correctness</td><td>All subprograms have complete Pre/Post con"
       & "tracts covering full behaviour</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Domain properties</td><td>Algebraic properties (commutativity, idemp"
       & "otence, convergence) proved</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>Enforcement</td><td><code>gnatprove</code> reports all functional co"
       & "ntracts proved, 0 unproved</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Platinum is a best-effort ideal, not a DAL compliance gate. Justified VCs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>pragma Annotate</code> for decidedly unprovable checks) count neither"
       & " as proved"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "nor as unproved and never downgrade the level; only unproved VCs do. The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "minimum DAL gates are Gold (DAL-A), Silver (DAL-B), and Bronze (DAL-C/D).</p"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""level-attainment-in-practice""><a class=""header"" href=""#level-attainm"
       & "ent-in-practice"">Level attainment in practice</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Each level subsumes all lower levels (Platinum implies Gold through Stone"
       & ")."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The <code>--dal</code> analysis checks for a minimum SPARK level. For DAL-C,"
       & " the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "minimum requirement is Bronze (flow analysis passes).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<pre><code class=""language-bash""># Check SPARK level of target project"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex --target=../Ada_CRDT --dal=C"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</code></pre>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""see-also""><a class=""header"" href=""#see-also"">See also</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><a href=""../usage/standards.html"">Standards</a> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the minimum proof bar per rigor tier across"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "DO-178C / ISO 26262 / IEC 62304</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><a href=""adacovex-dal-levels.html"">DAL Levels</a> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the per-level SPARK gates"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(Gold / Silver / Bronze / Stone)</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><a href=""../proof/16.1.0-ledger.html"">Proof ledger</a> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " adacovex"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own Platinum proof"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "results (725 VCs, 0 unproved under gnatprove 16.1.0)</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                    </main>"
