       & "                        <h1 id=""adacovextimezones""><a class=""header"" href=""#"
       & "adacovextimezones"">Adacovex.Timezones</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Timezone resolution and local-time formatting for adacovex.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex respects the operating system"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s timezone by default.  Users can"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "override it for a single invocation with "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "tz / "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "timezone.  Accepted"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "forms are a well-known IANA zone name (for example "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Asia/Singapore"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ") or a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "fixed UTC/GMT offset ("
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "UTC+8"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "GMT+8"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "UTC+08"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "GMT+08"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "UTC+08:30"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ").</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The crate has no library dependencies, so it ships no timezone database."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "A named zone resolves from a built-in table of common IANA names and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "their standard-time (non-DST) offsets.  A zone that may observe daylight"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "saving time (and any zone the table lacks) is probed against the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "platform tzdata "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code>zdump</code> + <code>date +%z</code> on Linux/WSL "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " for the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "DST-correct current offset; the table offset is the fallback when the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "probe is unavailable.  The system default offset comes from the standard"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Ada runtime (Ada.Calendar.Time_Zones.UTC_Time_Offset), which honours the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "TZ environment variable and the operating system"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s local timezone, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the default is always the operator"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s wall-clock timezone."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR-TZ: Timezone resolution and local-time formatting</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Note:</strong> All items in this package are public.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""types""><a class=""header"" href=""#types"">Types</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""type-timezone_info""><a class=""header"" href=""#type-timezone_info"">typ"
       & "e Timezone_Info</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<pre><code class=""language-ada"">type Timezone_Info is record"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Display      : String (1 .. Max_TZ_Name);"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Display_Len  : Natural := 0;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Offset_Secs  : Integer := 0;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Is_Named     : Boolean := False;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Result_Valid : Boolean := True;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "end record;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</code></pre>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""functions""><a class=""header"" href=""#functions"">Functions</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""function-default-return-adacovextimezonestimezone_info""><a class=""he"
       & "ader"" href=""#function-default-return-adacovextimezonestimezone_info"">functio"
       & "n Default return Adacovex.Timezones.Timezone_Info</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Returns:</strong>  Parse a user-supplied "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "tz / "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "timezone value.  Supported forms:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""function-now_text-info--adacovextimezonestimezone_info-return-standa"
       & "rdstring""><a class=""header"" href=""#function-now_text-info--adacovextimezones"
       & "timezone_info-return-standardstring"">function Now_Text (Info : Adacovex.Time"
       & "zones.Timezone_Info) return Standard.String</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Description</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td><code>Info</code></td><td>Resolved timezone.</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Returns:</strong> Current date/time text, or "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "unknown"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " when Info is invalid.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""function-utc_offset_display-offset_secs--standardinteger-return-stan"
       & "dardstring""><a class=""header"" href=""#function-utc_offset_display-offset_secs"
       & "--standardinteger-return-standardstring"">function UTC_Offset_Display (Offset"
       & "_Secs : Standard.Integer) return Standard.String</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Description</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td><code>Offset_Secs</code></td><td>Offset from UTC in seconds.</td></t"
       & "r>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Returns:</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "UTC[+-]HH:MM"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " display string.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
