       & ASCII.LF
       & "                        <h1 id=""badges""><a class=""header"" href=""#badges"">Bad"
       & "ges</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>This directory holds the SVG badges that adacovex renders for a target."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>make run-self</code> and <code>make prove</code> regenerate them from "
       & "the current"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "assessment.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""badge-set""><a class=""header"" href=""#badge-set"">Badge set</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>File</th><th>Badge</th><th>Meaning</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td><a href=""spark.svg"">spark.svg</a></td><td>SPARK level</td><td>the ta"
       & "rget"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s proof level (Platinum for adacovex itself)</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td><a href=""tests.svg"">tests.svg</a></td><td>tests</td><td>native test "
       & "pass count</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td><a href=""do178c.svg"">do178c.svg</a></td><td>DO-178C</td><td>the DAL "
       & "assessment badge</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td><a href=""iso26262.svg"">iso26262.svg</a></td><td>ISO 26262</td><td>th"
       & "e ASIL assessment badge</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td><a href=""iec62304.svg"">iec62304.svg</a></td><td>IEC 62304</td><td>th"
       & "e safety-class assessment badge</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td><a href=""docs.svg"">docs.svg</a></td><td>docstring coverage</td><td>t"
       & "he percentage of documented subprograms</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""how-to-regenerate""><a class=""header"" href=""#how-to-regenerate"">How t"
       & "o regenerate</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<pre><code class=""language-bash"">make prove     # SPARK proof + badges for a"
       & "dacovex itself"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "make run-self   # full self-assessment + badges"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</code></pre>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The SVG renderer is documented in the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a href=""../api-docs/adacovex-renderers-svg.html"">API reference</a>.  Badge "
       & "fields,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "colours, and shapes are part of the renderer contract; see the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a href=""../api-docs/adacovex_renderer_svg_tests.html"">renderer tests</a> fo"
       & "r the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "exact expectations.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Badge text uses British English and ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "English.  Technical terms follow the <a href=""../contributing/ste100-technic"
       & "al-names.html"">STE100 Technical Names"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dictionary</a>.</p>"
