       & "                    <main>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                        <h1 id=""adacovex-010""><a class=""header"" href=""#adaco"
       & "vex-010"">adacovex 0.1.0</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-07-26</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 0.0.0 -&gt; 0.1.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""changes""><a class=""header"" href=""#changes"">Changes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c1-source-scanner""><a class=""header"" href=""#c1-source-scanner"">C1: S"
       & "ource scanner</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Walks <code>.ads</code> files and extracts subprogram declarations, docst"
       & "ring tags"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>@param</code>, <code>@return</code>, <code>@field</code>, <code>@form"
       & "al</code>), and HLR tags.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c2-gnatprove-parser""><a class=""header"" href=""#c2-gnatprove-parser"">C"
       & "2: GNATprove parser</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Reads <code>gnatprove.out</code> summary tables per check category.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c3-test-result-parser""><a class=""header"" href=""#c3-test-result-parse"
       & "r"">C3: Test-result parser</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Reads AUnit Markdown test results and raw stdout.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c4-do-178c-parser""><a class=""header"" href=""#c4-do-178c-parser"">C4: D"
       & "O-178C parser</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Reads <code>HLR.md</code> and <code>LLR.md</code> requirements documents."
       & "</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c5-dal-compliance-assessment""><a class=""header"" href=""#c5-dal-compli"
       & "ance-assessment"">C5: DAL compliance assessment</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Evaluates HLR trace, orphan tags, test status, and minimum SPARK proof le"
       & "vel.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c6-ansi-terminal-renderer""><a class=""header"" href=""#c6-ansi-terminal"
       & "-renderer"">C6: ANSI terminal renderer</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Color-coded terminal report.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c7-svg-badge-renderer""><a class=""header"" href=""#c7-svg-badge-rendere"
       & "r"">C7: SVG badge renderer</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>SPARK level, test status, and DO-178C status badges.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c8-markdown-report-renderer""><a class=""header"" href=""#c8-markdown-re"
       & "port-renderer"">C8: Markdown report renderer</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>VERIFICATION.md</code> + <code>TRACE.md</code> reports.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c9-html-dashboard-with-json-api""><a class=""header"" href=""#c9-html-da"
       & "shboard-with-json-api"">C9: HTML dashboard with JSON API</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Web dashboard with embedded CSS and a JSON API endpoint.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c10-http11-server""><a class=""header"" href=""#c10-http11-server"">C10: "
       & "HTTP/1.1 server</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Built on <code>GNAT.Sockets</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c11-cli-argument-parser""><a class=""header"" href=""#c11-cli-argument-p"
       & "arser"">C11: CLI argument parser</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Supports <code>--key=value</code> and <code>--key value</code> forms.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c12-self-compliance-documentation""><a class=""header"" href=""#c12-self"
       & "-compliance-documentation"">C12: Self-compliance documentation</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>HLR.md</code>, <code>LLR.md</code>, and <code>TRACE.md</code> docum"
       & "enting the project itself.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c13-zero-dependency-design""><a class=""header"" href=""#c13-zero-depend"
       & "ency-design"">C13: Zero-dependency design</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Only the GNAT runtime required, with compile-time bounded storage and no "
       & "heap"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "allocation.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c14-makefile-targets""><a class=""header"" href=""#c14-makefile-targets"""
       & ">C14: Makefile targets</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>build</code> / <code>alr build</code>, <code>prove</code> / <code>a"
       & "lr gnatprove</code>, <code>fmt</code> (gnatpp), <code>lint</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>api-docs</code> (gnatdoc), a git-log based <code>changelog</code>, and"
       & " <code>run-self</code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>run-self-serve</code> / <code>run-self-badges</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""test-suite""><a class=""header"" href=""#test-suite"">Test Suite</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>No native test suite at this release; the zero-dependency test framework"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>src/tests/</code>) shipped with 1.0.0 (152 tests across 7 categories)"
       & ".</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""proof-results""><a class=""header"" href=""#proof-results"">Proof Results"
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>No proof campaign was recorded for this release; the first recorded SPARK"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "metrics are in 1.0.0 (Platinum, 28/28 VCs proved, AoRTE-free).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""traceability""><a class=""header"" href=""#traceability"">Traceability</a"
       & "></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Introduced <code>docs/HLR.md</code>, <code>docs/LLR.md</code>, and <code>"
       & "docs/TRACE.md</code> self-compliance"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "documentation. Tags tracked at this release (from <code>docs/HLR.md</code>):"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>HLR-SCAN</code>, <code>HLR-PROOF</code>, <code>HLR-TEST</code>, <code>"
       & "HLR-COMPLIANCE</code>, <code>HLR-RENDER-ANSI</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>HLR-RENDER-SVG</code>, <code>HLR-RENDER-MD</code>, <code>HLR-RENDER-HT"
       & "ML</code>, <code>HLR-SERVER</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>HLR-CLI</code>, <code>HLR-METRICS</code>, <code>HLR-ARCH</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
