       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-07-29</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 0.1.0 -&gt; 1.0.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""changes""><a class=""header"" href=""#changes"">Changes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c1-strict-mode-default----relaxed-flag""><a class=""header"" href=""#c1-"
       & "strict-mode-default----relaxed-flag"">C1: Strict mode (default) + <code>--rel"
       & "axed</code> flag</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Strict mode is now the default: the scanner covers ALL directories (excep"
       & "t the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "always-excluded <code>.git</code>, <code>obj</code>, <code>tests</code>, <co"
