       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>.adacovex/patches/</code> docstring overlays, ensuring full compliance"
       & " coverage"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "including vendored code. The <code>--relaxed</code> flag disables strict mod"
       & "e: it enables"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the directory skip list (default: <code>demo,deps,examples</code>) and disab"
       & "les patch file"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "application. Use case: strict for compliance audits, relaxed for quick dev-c"
       & "ycle"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "checks.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>This reverses the 0.1.0 relaxed-by-default behaviour. Existing commands t"
       & "hat"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "relied on <code>demo</code>/<code>deps</code>/<code>examples</code> being sk"
       & "ipped must add <code>--relaxed</code> (or"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--skip-dir=NAME</code> explicitly) to keep the old behaviour.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c2---skip-dir-flag""><a class=""header"" href=""#c2---skip-dir-flag"">C2:"
       & " <code>--skip-dir</code> flag</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>New <code>--skip-dir=NAME</code> (repeatable) adds directory names to the"
       & " scanner"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s skip"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "list, complementing the default skip list (<code>demo,deps,examples</code>) "
       & "for projects"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "with additional third-party code. Only effective in <code>--relaxed</code> m"
       & "ode.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c3-adacovexpatches-mechanism""><a class=""header"" href=""#c3-adacovexpa"
       & "tches-mechanism"">C3: <code>.adacovex/patches/</code> mechanism</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Patch files at <code>&lt;target&gt;/.adacovex/patches/&lt;relative-path&g"
       & "t;</code> allow documenting"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "vendored/third-party <code>.ads</code> files without modifying the originals"
       & ". Patch files"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "are valid Ada specs with docstrings, merged by subprogram name; each overloa"
       & "d"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "requires one patch entry, and the patch engine assigns entries to the next"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "undocumented original. The <code>.adacovex</code> directory is always exclud"
       & "ed from source"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "scanning.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c4-plain-docstring-summary-detection""><a class=""header"" href=""#c4-pl"
       & "ain-docstring-summary-detection"">C4: Plain docstring summary detection</a></"
       & "h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Previously only <code>@param</code>/<code>@return</code>/<code>@field</co"
       & "de> tags counted as docstrings. Now any"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--  </code> (two dashes + two spaces) comment line before a subprogram"
       & " declaration"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "is recognised as a docstring, even without a tag, so no-param procedures wit"
       & "h"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "only a summary line are correctly counted.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Known scanner quirks at this release: <code>(null record)</code> typed pa"
       & "rameters are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "still counted as parameters (benign "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " they are parameters, just"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "parameterless), and docstring detection requires the strict <code>--  </code"
       & "> prefix "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>-- </code> (one space) and <code>---</code> (three dashes) do not coun"
       & "t.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c5---verbose-output""><a class=""header"" href=""#c5---verbose-output"">C"
       & "5: <code>--verbose</code> output</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code>--verbose</code> flag now produces pipeline diagnostic output t"
       & "o stderr: step"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "labels, package counts, SPARK level, test file path, and output paths"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(previously a no-op placeholder).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c6-make-bump-version-target""><a class=""header"" href=""#c6-make-bump-v"
       & "ersion-target"">C6: <code>make bump-version</code> target</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>make bump-version VERSION=x.y.z</code> bumps the version across <co"
       & "de>alire.toml</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>alire-dev.toml</code>, <code>src/adacovex.ads</code>, and creates/upda"
       & "tes the changelog,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "modelled after the <code>Ada_CRDT</code> project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s bump workflow.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c7-make-run-ada-crdt-strict-mode""><a class=""header"" href=""#c7-make-r"
       & "un-ada-crdt-strict-mode"">C7: <code>make run-ada-crdt</code> strict mode</a><"
       & "/h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>make run-ada-crdt</code> now runs in strict mode (no <code>--relaxe"
       & "d</code>) and achieves 100%"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "docstring coverage on Ada_CRDT including the vendored vt100 code via"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>.adacovex/patches/demo/deps/vt100/vt100.ads</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c8-patch-overload-handling""><a class=""header"" href=""#c8-patch-overlo"
       & "ad-handling"">C8: Patch overload handling</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>Apply_Patches</code> now skips already-documented originals when se"
       & "arching for name"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "matches, so overloaded subprograms get correctly assigned to the next"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "undocumented overload instead of re-patching the first one.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c9-always-excluded-directories""><a class=""header"" href=""#c9-always-e"
       & "xcluded-directories"">C9: Always-excluded directories</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>config</code> and <code>.adacovex</code> added to the hardcoded alw"
       & "ays-excluded directories"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(alongside <code>.git</code>, <code>obj</code>, <code>tests</code>): <code>c"
       & "onfig/</code> contains generated Alire"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "configuration, not production source, and <code>.adacovex/</code> contains p"
       & "atch metadata"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "relevant only to the patch engine.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c10-production-scalability-unbounded""><a class=""header"" href=""#c10-p"
       & "roduction-scalability-unbounded"">C10: Production scalability (unbounded)</a>"
       & "</h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Packages and subprograms now use <code>Ada. Containers. Vectors</code> (h"
       & "eap-allocated, up to <code>Natural'Last</code> ~ 2.1B); the compile-time <co"
       & "de>Max_Packages</code> / <code>Max_Subprogs</code> bounds are eliminated ent"
       & "irely, so projects of any size are supported without recompilation. VC count"
       & "s use unbounded <code>Natural</code> fields (the <code>Max_VC_Count</code> d"
       & "ead type removed).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The line buffer was raised 2048 -&gt; 8192 characters with automatic trun"
       & "cation draining (silently skips remaining chars on lines &gt; 8192), the pat"
       & "h buffer 512 -&gt; 4096 (matches <code>PATH_MAX</code>), and the filename bu"
       & "ffer 64 -&gt; 128 (matches Ada"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s max identifier length). A line-truncation guard detects when the buffer wa"
       & "s filled (partial read) and drains the remainder of the line, preventing str"
       & "eam desynchronisation that previously caused false subprogram declarations. "
       & "Dead code removed: <code>Max_Params</code>, <code>Max_VC_Count</code>, <code"
       & ">Max_Badge_Path</code>, <code>Max_Metrics</code>, <code>Max_Skip_Dirs</code>"
       & ", <code>VC_Info</code>, <code>VC_Vector</code>, <code>Param_Count</code>.</p"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c11---dal-validation""><a class=""header"" href=""#c11---dal-validation"""
       & ">C11: <code>--dal</code> validation</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>--dal=Z</code> (or any value outside A-E) now prints an error and e"
       & "xits with code 1"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "instead of silently defaulting to DAL-C. Related CLI caveat: a relative"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--target=PATH</code> is resolved against the CWD, so behaviour depends"
       & " on the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "invocation directory.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c12-post-release-alire-crate-renamed-to-covex""><a class=""header"" hre"
       & "f=""#c12-post-release-alire-crate-renamed-to-covex"">C12: Post-release: Alire "
       & "crate renamed to <code>covex</code></a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Alire crate was renamed from <code>adacovex</code> to <code>covex</co"
       & "de> to comply with Alire"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "naming rules. The binary name stays <code>adacovex_main</code> via"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>project-files = [""adacovex.gpr""]</code> in all manifest files."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>alire/releases/covex-*.toml</code> and <code>index/ad/covex/*.toml</co"
       & "de> were created and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>index/ad/adacovex/</code> removed. New <code>make release</code>, <cod"
       & "e>make publish</code>, and <code>make test-publish</code> targets support th"
       & "e Alire community-index publishing workflow.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c13-post-release-spark-proof-restored-to-platinum-28-vcs""><a class="""
       & "header"" href=""#c13-post-release-spark-proof-restored-to-platinum-28-vcs"">C13"
       & ": Post-release: SPARK proof restored to Platinum (28 VCs)</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Restored <code>pragma SPARK_Mode (On)</code> at package level in <code>ad"
       & "acovex-types.ads</code>;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "vector instantiations and vector-containing types (<code>Package_Info</code>"
       & ","
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Test_Summary</code>, <code>DAL_Assessment</code>, <code>Badge_Config</"
       & "code>) moved into a nested"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Implementation</code> package with <code>pragma SPARK_Mode (Off)</code"
       & ">. SPARK-clean types"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>SPARK_Level</code>, <code>Proof_Summary</code>, <code>Docstring_Metri"
       & "cs</code>, conversion functions)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "remain in the outer <code>On</code> region, restoring 28 VCs. <code>SPARK_Mo"
       & "de (On)</code> was"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "removed from <code>adacovex-parsers-tests.ads</code> and <code>adacovex-rend"
       & "erers-svg.ads</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(reference vector-containing types), and <code>gnatprove/gnatprove.out</code"
       & "> was added"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "to the search paths in <code>Parse_Prove_From_Project</code> so <code>make r"
       & "un-self</code> finds the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proof output.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""fixes""><a class=""header"" href=""#fixes"">Fixes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""h1-post-release-make-fmt-non-determinism""><a class=""header"" href=""#h"
       & "1-post-release-make-fmt-non-determinism"">H1: Post-release: <code>make fmt</c"
       & "ode> non-determinism</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Replaced the non-ASCII almost-equal sign (U+2248) with ASCII <code>~</cod"
       & "e> in an"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>adacovex-types.ads</code> source comment. gnatformat was re-encoding t"
       & "he UTF-8"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "character on each run, creating an oscillating diff that never converged; th"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "format is now idempotent across repeated runs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""h2-post-release-make-doc-non-determinism""><a class=""header"" href=""#h"
       & "2-post-release-make-doc-non-determinism"">H2: Post-release: <code>make doc</c"
       & "ode> non-determinism</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Propagated the ASCII-only fix to the generated API docs; <code>make doc</"
       & "code> now"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "produces identical output on repeated runs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""h3-post-release-compliance-daladb-desc_field-overflow""><a class=""hea"
       & "der"" href=""#h3-post-release-compliance-daladb-desc_field-overflow"">H3: Post-"
       & "release: <code>compliance-dal.adb</code> <code>Desc_Field</code> overflow</a"
       & "></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>Append</code> to the <code>Failed_Reasons</code> vector now properl"
       & "y constructs a 128-char"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Desc_Field</code> before pushing, fixing a <code>Constraint_Error</cod"
       & "e> on long messages.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""h4-post-release-guarded---port-positivevalue-crash""><a class=""header"
       & """ href=""#h4-post-release-guarded---port-positivevalue-crash"">H4: Post-releas"
       & "e: guarded <code>--port</code> <code>Positive'Value</code> crash</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>--port</code> argument parsing in <code>adacovex-config.adb</code> "
       & "now wraps <code>Positive'Value</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "in an exception handler. Non-integer or zero/negative port values produce a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "clear error message instead of crashing with <code>Constraint_Error</code>.<"
       & "/p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""h5-post-release-file-descriptor-leak-protection-in-parser-read-loops"
       & """><a class=""header"" href=""#h5-post-release-file-descriptor-leak-protection-i"
       & "n-parser-read-loops"">H5: Post-release: file-descriptor leak protection in pa"
       & "rser read loops</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>All five <code>while not End_Of_File</code> read loops across the four pa"
       & "rser units"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>adacovex-parsers-gnatprove.adb</code>, <code>adacovex-parsers-tests.a"
       & "db</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>adacovex-parsers-do178c.adb</code>, <code>adacovex-parsers-source.adb<"
       & "/code>) are wrapped in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "an inner <code>exception when others =&gt; Close(F); raise;</code> block: if"
       & " <code>Get_Line</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "raises mid-file, the file handle is closed and the exception propagates,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "preventing FD leaks.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""h6-post-release-server-graceful-shutdown-and-backoff""><a class=""head"
       & "er"" href=""#h6-post-release-server-graceful-shutdown-and-backoff"">H6: Post-re"
       & "lease: server graceful shutdown and backoff</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Worker tasks now check <code>Svr_State. Running</code> at the top of the "
       & "loop and exit when <code>False</code>. On <code>Socket_Error</code>, workers"
       & " increment a backoff counter and <code>delay 0.1</code>; after 100 consecuti"
       & "ve errors they set <code>Running := False</code> and exit, fixing the busy-l"
       & "oop. The main server loop changed from <code>delay 3600.0</code> to <code>de"
       & "lay 1.0</code> with `exit when not Svr_State.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Running<code>, enabling timely shutdown, and </code>Running<code>is set</"
       & "code>False<code>on any exception in</code>Start<code>, ensuring socket clean"
       & "up via the existing </code>Close_Socket (Listener)` handler.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""h7-post-release-iterative-directory-traversal-no-recursion""><a class"
       & "=""header"" href=""#h7-post-release-iterative-directory-traversal-no-recursion"""
       & ">H7: Post-release: iterative directory traversal (no recursion)</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>Search_Dir</code> in <code>adacovex-parsers-source.adb</code> was c"
       & "onverted from recursive to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "iterative using an explicit <code>Dir_Stacks</code> vector, eliminating stac"
       & "k overflow"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "risk at deep directory nestings (&gt; ~1000 levels).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""h8-post-release-dynamic-html-buffer-no-32kb-cap""><a class=""header"" h"
       & "ref=""#h8-post-release-dynamic-html-buffer-no-32kb-cap"">H8: Post-release: dyn"
       & "amic HTML buffer (no 32KB cap)</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>Render_Dashboard</code> and <code>Render_Metrics_JSON</code> in <co"
       & "de>adacovex-renderers-html.adb</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "replaced their fixed 32768-byte and 4096-byte stack buffers with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Ada.Strings.Unbounded.Unbounded_String</code>, so dashboard output for"
       & " large"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "projects is no longer silently truncated.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""test-suite""><a class=""header"" href=""#test-suite"">Test Suite</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>152 tests pass across 7 categories: Types conversions (21), DAL complianc"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(2), Source scanner (40), GNATprove parser (24), Test-result parser (27), CL"
       & "I"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "config (8), SVG renderer (30).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""proof-results""><a class=""header"" href=""#proof-results"">Proof Results"
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Self-assessment: <strong>Platinum</strong> (28/28 VCs proved, AoRTE-free)"
       & "."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Ada_CRDT (strict): <strong>Platinum</strong> (273 VCs, 5 justified overflow "
       & "checks)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Ada_CRDT (relaxed): <strong>Platinum</strong> (273 VCs, 5 justified).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""traceability""><a class=""header"" href=""#traceability"">Traceability</a"
       & "></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>No new HLRs were recorded for this release. The tags tracked in <code>doc"
       & "s/HLR.md</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "at this release: <code>HLR-SCAN</code>, <code>HLR-PROOF</code>, <code>HLR-TE"
       & "ST</code>, <code>HLR-COMPLIANCE</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>HLR-DAL-A..E</code>, <code>HLR-RENDER-ANSI</code>, <code>HLR-RENDER-SV"
       & "G</code>, <code>HLR-RENDER-MD</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>HLR-RENDER-HTML</code>, <code>HLR-SERVER</code>, <code>HLR-CLI</code>,"
       & " <code>HLR-METRICS</code>, <code>HLR-ARCH</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
