       & ASCII.LF
       & "                        <h1 id=""adacovex-1120""><a class=""header"" href=""#adac"
       & "ovex-1120"">adacovex 1.12.0</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-18</em>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Version bumped 1.11.0 -&gt; 1.12.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""changes""><a class=""header"" href=""#changes"">Changes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c1---themename-flag-and-a-lightdarksystem-theme-dropdown""><a class="""
       & "header"" href=""#c1---themename-flag-and-a-lightdarksystem-theme-dropdown"">C1:"
       & " <code>--theme=NAME</code> flag and a light/dark/system theme dropdown</a></"
       & "h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>--serve</code> gains a <code>--theme=NAME</code> flag (<code>system"
       & "</code> | <code>light</code> | <code>dark</code>, default"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>system</code>) that sets the dashboard"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s initial theme. The header control is now"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "a <strong>dropdown with three options "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " light mode, dark mode, and system theme</strong>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " instead of a two-state button. <code>system</code> follows"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>prefers-color-scheme</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c2-contextual-help-keyword-with-flagsubcommand-topics""><a class=""hea"
       & "der"" href=""#c2-contextual-help-keyword-with-flagsubcommand-topics"">C2: conte"
       & "xtual <code>help</code> keyword with flag/subcommand topics</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>help</code> is now a subcommand-like keyword that prints <strong>co"
       & "ntextual help</strong> for a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "single flag or subcommand instead of the full usage. The topic is matched"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "case-insensitively with an optional leading <code>--</code>, and may appear "
       & "on either"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "side of the keyword: <code>adacovex help serve</code>, <code>adacovex help -"
       & "-serve</code>, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>adacovex --serve help</code> all print the serve-specific help. <code>"
       & "adacovex help</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(with no topic) and <code>--help</code> print the full usage. Unknown topics"
       & " print the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "full usage with an "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Unknown topic"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " notice.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c3-save-settings-button-with-cli-overrides-persisted-theme-priority"""
       & "><a class=""header"" href=""#c3-save-settings-button-with-cli-overrides-persist"
       & "ed-theme-priority"">C3: Save settings button with CLI-overrides-persisted the"
       & "me priority</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Theme persistence moved from automatic (saving on every dropdown change) "
       & "to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "an explicit <strong>Save settings</strong> button next to the dropdown, whic"
       & "h writes the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "current selection to <code>localStorage</code> (with a brief "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Saved"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " confirmation)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Theme resolution on page load is now: an explicit CLI theme"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>--theme=light</code> / <code>--theme=dark</code>) always wins; otherw"
       & "ise the saved"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>localStorage</code> choice if one was saved; otherwise the system"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>prefers-color-scheme</code>. <code>--theme=system</code> (or no flag) "
       & "leaves the browser"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "saved choice in control.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c4-man-page-rendering-fixed-no-more-runaway-gaps""><a class=""header"" "
       & "href=""#c4-man-page-rendering-fixed-no-more-runaway-gaps"">C4: man page render"
       & "ing fixed (no more runaway gaps)</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Two roff bugs made the man page render with broken spacing. The SYNOPSIS "
       & "used the <code>. RI</code> macro with separate arguments, which groff concat"
       & "enates without spaces (<code>[--format=FMT][--out=PATH]</code>), and long op"
       & "tion lines interleaved with <code>.br</code> caused groff"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s terminal output to pad the paragraph with tab stops (<code>adacovex&lt;big"
       & " gap&gt;sbom</code>). Each SYNOPSIS line is now a single quoted `.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>B` argument, and every MODES / EXIT-STATUS description is a single logica"
       & "l line that groff wraps with the proper hanging indent, so the page renders "
       & "cleanly.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c5-json-api-documented-and-contextual-help-extended-to-all-flags""><a"
       & " class=""header"" href=""#c5-json-api-documented-and-contextual-help-extended-t"
       & "o-all-flags"">C5: JSON API documented and contextual help extended to all fla"
       & "gs</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code>--serve</code> documentation now explains the JSON API end to e"
       & "nd: start the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "server with <code>adacovex --target=. --serve --port=8080</code>, then"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>curl http://localhost:8080/api/metrics</code>; the response fields (<c"
       & "ode>spark_level</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>total_vcs</code>, <code>proved_vcs</code>, <code>tests_passed</code>, "
       & "<code>tests_failed</code>, <code>doc_coverage</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>standard</code>, <code>level</code>, <code>dal_status</code>, and the "
       & "per-standard <code>standards</code> object)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "are documented in the CLI reference and README. Contextual help topics were"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "added for the remaining flags: <code>--emit-svg</code> / <code>--no-svg</cod"
       & "e>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--emit-markdown</code>, <code>--skip-dir</code> / <code>--relaxed</cod"
       & "e>, <code>--verbose</code>, <code>--no-sbom</code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--sbom-format</code>, the <code>prove</code> subcommand options (<code"
       & ">--jobs</code>, <code>--level</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--timeout</code>, <code>--steps</code>, <code>--memlimit</code>, <code"
       & ">--force</code>, <code>--no-loop-unrolling</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--no-inlining</code>), and the <code>man</code> flags (<code>--check</"
       & "code>, <code>--dir</code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c6-theme-query-parameter-on-the-dashboard-url""><a class=""header"" hre"
       & "f=""#c6-theme-query-parameter-on-the-dashboard-url"">C6: <code>?theme=</code> "
       & "query parameter on the dashboard URL</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The served dashboard accepts a <code>?theme=light|dark|system</code> quer"
       & "y parameter"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(for embedding), which takes priority over everything else. Theme"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "resolution on page load is now: query parameter, then explicit CLI"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--theme=light|dark</code>, then the saved <code>localStorage</code> ch"
       & "oice, then the system"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>prefers-color-scheme</code>. Theme persistence remains <strong>localSt"
       & "orage-only</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & ASCII.LF
       & "no cookies are used anywhere.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c7-adacovex-action-builds-the-targets-native-tests-before-running-th"
       & "em""><a class=""header"" href=""#c7-adacovex-action-builds-the-targets-native-te"
       & "sts-before-running-them"">C7: adacovex action builds the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s native tests before running them</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The composite action"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code>run-tests</code> input claims to "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "build and run the native"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "test suite"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", but in a consumer workspace the <code>build: true</code> step builds"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex in a scratch checkout and never touched the target "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>test-command: ./test_crdt</code> failed with <code>./test_crdt: No suc"
       & "h file or directory</code> (exit 127), which broke Ada_CRDT"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s release workflow. The action"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "now runs <code>alr build</code> in the target root before executing <code>te"
       & "st-command</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(in the self-assessment case that is an incremental no-op after the adacovex"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "build). The man-page test suite gained a SYNOPSIS regression check (no"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>.RI</code> concatenation artifacts).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c8-dashboard-html-is-a-real-file-bundled-at-build-time""><a class=""he"
       & "ader"" href=""#c8-dashboard-html-is-a-real-file-bundled-at-build-time"">C8: das"
       & "hboard HTML is a real file bundled at build time</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code>--serve</code> dashboard"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s static shell (doctype, CSS, header with the theme"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dropdown + Save settings button, footer with an embed hint, and the theme"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "script) moved out of the Ada renderer"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s line-by-line string literals into a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "single HTML file, <code>resources/dashboard.html</code>. <code>tools/gen-das"
       & "hboard.py</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(pure stdlib, typed, <code>--check</code> mode like gen-version.py) bundles "
       & "it into"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>src/adacovex-dashboard_template.ads</code> at <code>make build</code> "
       & "(committed and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "byte-identical when unchanged), and <code>Adacovex.Renderers.HTML</code> now"
       & " only"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "builds the dynamic card markup, injecting it at the <code>__CARDS__</code> p"
       & "laceholder"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and filling the <code>__THEME__</code> initial-theme marker. Editing the pag"
       & "e chrome"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "is now a plain HTML edit with no Ada knowledge required.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c9-embed-hint-on-the-dashboard""><a class=""header"" href=""#c9-embed-hi"
       & "nt-on-the-dashboard"">C9: embed hint on the dashboard</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dashboard footer now shows "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Embed: append <code>?theme=light|dark|system</code> to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the URL to pin the theme"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", and the theme dropdown carries a matching"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>title</code> attribute, so embedders discover the query-param pinning "
       & "from the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "page itself.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c10-man-page-documents-theme-priority-and-the-json-api""><a class=""he"
       & "ader"" href=""#c10-man-page-documents-theme-priority-and-the-json-api"">C10: ma"
       & "n page documents theme priority and the JSON API</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The man page"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code>--serve</code> entry now documents the full theme resolution"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "order (<code>?theme=</code> query param, then explicit <code>--theme=light</"
       & "code>/<code>dark</code>, then the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "saved <code>localStorage</code> choice, then the system preference), that pe"
       & "rsistence"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "is localStorage-only (no cookies), and the <code>GET /api/metrics</code> JSO"
       & "N endpoint"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "with a curl example.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c11-action-integration-test-for-consumer-run-tests""><a class=""header"
       & """ href=""#c11-action-integration-test-for-consumer-run-tests"">C11: action int"
       & "egration test for consumer <code>run-tests</code></a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A new <code>consumer-run-tests</code> CI job restructures the workspace i"
       & "nto a minimal"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "zero-dependency fixture crate (no <code>adacovex.gpr</code>, so the action"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s consumer"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "branch triggers), copies the action in, and runs it with <code>build: true</"
       & "code> +"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>run-tests: true</code> + <code>test-command: ./fixture_main</code>. Th"
       & "is pins the fix for"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the Ada_CRDT release failure (the action must build the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s native"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tests before running <code>test-command</code>); the target build runs in th"
       & "e target"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "root so subdirectory <code>target</code> values work too. The action"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s internal"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Checkout</code> step is now conditional (only re-checks-out when the w"
       & "orkspace is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "empty) so a consumer fixture already present in the workspace survives, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the scratch source clone cleans its directory first.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""test-suite""><a class=""header"" href=""#test-suite"">Test Suite</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>647 tests (was 501), across 12 categories (was 10). The CLI-config catego"
       & "ry (112 checks) covers <code>--version</code>, the <code>man</code> subcomma"
       & "nd and its <code>--check</code> / <code>--dir</code> flags, the <code>sbom</"
       & "code> subcommand"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s and <code>--serve</code> dashboard"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s standard-awareness defaults (all standards by default, narrowed by <code>-"
       & "-standard</code> / <code>--asil</code> / <code>--class</code>), the <code>--"
       & "theme</code> flag (default <code>system</code>, light/dark parsing, invalid-"
       & "value errors), and the contextual <code>help</code> keyword (topic capture i"
       & "n both orders, bare <code>help</code>, and newly documented flags such as <c"
       & "ode>--emit-svg</code> and <code>--verbose</code>); the HTML/Markdown rendere"
       & "rs category (34 checks) covers the dashboard"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s theme dropdown (all three options, the <code>data-initial-theme</code> CLI"
       & "-theme marker, the Save settings button, <code>saveTheme</code> persistence,"
       & " the <code>? theme=</code> query param, the embed hint, the bundled template"
       & " shell, <code>data-theme</code> override, <code>prefers-color-scheme</code>,"
       & " and <code>localStorage</code>, plus no leftover <code>__CARDS__</code>/<cod"
       & "e>__THEME__</code> placeholders) on top of the standard-aware dashboard and "
       & "JSON output; the DAL compliance category (16) gained the cached-HLR parse ro"
       & "und-trip; the SBOM generator category (118) gained the dependency-graph cach"
       & "e round-trip; the Man page renderer category (18 checks) covers page structu"
       & "re, the embedded version, an install/read-back round-trip, the <code>Update_"
       & "Database</code> man-db contract, and a SYNOPSIS regression check (single quo"
       & "ted <code>. B</code> lines, no `.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>RI` concatenation); the VCS support category (29 checks) covers marker-fi"
       & "le detection for every VCS, display and tool-binary names, and the UX-conver"
       & "sion recommendations.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""proof-results""><a class=""header"" href=""#proof-results"">Proof Results"
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Platinum, 408/408 VCs proved across 45 analysed units (up from 44): the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--theme</code> additions (the <code>Dashboard_Theme</code> type and it"
       & "s <code>To_String</code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>To_Theme</code> / <code>Is_Valid_Theme</code> conversions in <code>Ada"
       & "covex.Types</code>) reuse the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "already-proved uppercase/parse patterns and add 7 VCs, all proved; the new"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "bundled dashboard template package (<code>Adacovex.Dashboard_Template</code>"
       & ", a String"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "constant generated from <code>resources/dashboard.html</code>) adds one anal"
       & "ysed unit"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "with no proof obligations; the VCS and man-page packages are non-SPARK I/O"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "code and add no proof obligations. Proven with <code>make prove</code> under"
       & " gnatprove"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "16.1.0 (<code>--steps=10000</code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""traceability""><a class=""header"" href=""#traceability"">Traceability</a"
       & "></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>No new HLRs. The dashboard/theme/help work stays covered by the existing"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>HLR-CLI</code> (<code>src/core/adacovex-config.ads</code>) and <code>H"
       & "LR-RENDER-HTML</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>src/renderers/adacovex-renderers-html.ads</code>/<code>.adb</code>) t"
       & "ags; the bundled"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "template package is generated data (no subprograms, no HLR), and the action"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and CI changes are workflow files that add no traceability.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
