       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " suggestion</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>An unknown <code>--flag</code> now fails with exit code 1 and prints "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Unknown option"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ASCII.LF
       & "plus a suggestion of the closest known flag (edit distance &lt;= 2), so a ty"
       & "po"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "like <code>--target=. --theme=dar</code> or <code>--srev</code> is caught in"
       & "stead of silently"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "ignored. Known flags are unaffected and <code>help</code> topics still resol"
       & "ve for"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "unknown-but-fuzzy-matching inputs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c3-doc-sync-tools-scan-the-whole-tree-no-hardcoded-file-lists""><a cl"
