       & ASCII.LF
       & "                        <h1 id=""adacovex-1180""><a class=""header"" href=""#adac"
       & "ovex-1180"">adacovex 1.18.0</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-23</em>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Version bumped 1.17.0 -&gt; 1.18.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""changes""><a class=""header"" href=""#changes"">Changes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c1-quiet-by-default-prove-output----quiet-and---suppress-warningsset"
       & "s""><a class=""header"" href=""#c1-quiet-by-default-prove-output----quiet-and---"
       & "suppress-warningssets"">C1: quiet-by-default prove output "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code>--quiet</code> and <code>--suppress-warnings=SETS</code></a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code>prove</code> subcommand"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s stdout is now <strong>quiet by default for local runs</strong>:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "GNATprove"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s benign informational messages (the default suppression set "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the loop-unrolling/inlining notice blocks) are filtered out of the replayed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "output, so a local <code>adacovex prove</code> no longer prints the purely-i"
       & "nformational"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>cannot unroll loop (too many loop iterations) [info-unrolling-inlining"
       & "]</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "notices. The filter drops whole message blocks (tag line, <code>info:</code>"
       & "/<code>--&gt;</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "header, and any <code>+</code> sub-message in the in-instantiation shape) wh"
       & "ile every"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "other gnatprove line "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " checks, warnings, and the summary "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " passes through"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "untouched. The proof outcome is never affected: the notices are informationa"
       & "l"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "only.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Three ways to control it:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>--quiet</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " explicit request for the default suppression set (which is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "already the default, so this is the documented spelling of the default"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "behaviour). Keep it for CI-adjacent scripts that want to say what they mean."
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>--suppress-warnings</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " alias of <code>--quiet</code>, kept for compatibility with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "1.17.0.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>--suppress-warnings=SETS</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " suppress a custom comma-separated list of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gnatprove info tags: a set name <code>S</code> suppresses blocks tagged <cod"
       & "e>[info-S]</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(or a bare <code>[S]</code>). Example: <code>--suppress-warnings=unrolling-i"
       & "nlining,xyz</code>.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>--verbose</code> always wins: it shows every message and disables s"
       & "uppression"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "entirely. <strong>CI passes <code>--verbose</code></strong> in both this pro"
       & "ject"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s workflows"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>ci.yml</code>, <code>release.yml</code>) and the Ada_CRDT dogfood wor"
       & "kflows, so CI output"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "stays authoritative "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the composite action forwards the <code>verbose</code> input to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "both the assessment step and the <code>Run GNATprove</code> step. Local runs"
       & " are quiet"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "without any flag; nothing is hidden in CI.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The filtering lives in <code>Adacovex.Prove.Replay_Suppressed</code>, whi"
       & "ch now takes"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the comma-separated set list (empty = default set) instead of hardcoding the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "single unrolling tag. <code>Prove_Options</code> carries the set list, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>CLI_Config</code> tracks the effective quiet state plus an explicit-fl"
       & "ag marker so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--quiet</code>/<code>--suppress-warnings</code> still validate as prov"
       & "e-mode flags without a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "plain local run tripping the "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "requires the prove subcommand"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " check.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c2-loop-unrolling-notices-eliminated-at-the-source""><a class=""header"
       & """ href=""#c2-loop-unrolling-notices-eliminated-at-the-source"">C2: loop-unroll"
       & "ing notices eliminated at the source</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code>prove</code> subcommand always passes <code>--no-loop-unrolling"
       & "</code> to gnatprove (as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "of 1.17.0), so gnatprove never <em>emits</em> the "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "cannot unroll loop"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " notice in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the first place; the C1 suppression is the safety net for any residual info"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "messages from other tags or other gnatprove versions. Ada_CRDT"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code>make prove</code> and its CI workflows also pass <code>--no-loop-unr"
       & "olling</code> explicitly, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the notices are gone there too with the current published binary, not just"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the next release. Proof-neutral: 720/720 adacovex and 589/589 Ada_CRDT VCs,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "0 unproved, with and without the flag.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""test-suite""><a class=""header"" href=""#test-suite"">Test Suite</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>865 tests passing (was 853) across 14 categories: the config category gro"
       & "ws"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "from 124 to 136 with the new <code>--quiet</code> / <code>--suppress-warning"
       & "s</code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--suppress-warnings=SETS</code> parsing checks (including the quiet-by"
       & "-default"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "defaults: suppression on, empty set list, explicit flag unset). All other"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "categories unchanged. Counts synced with <code>make test-count</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""proof-results""><a class=""header"" href=""#proof-results"">Proof Results"
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Platinum, 720/720 VCs proved across 49 analysed units (unchanged from"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "1.17.0): the C1/C2 changes touch CLI parsing, the prove option record, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the output-replay filter "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " all default-off or I/O-bound bodies, so no new"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proof obligations. 0 unproved, 0 justified. Re-verified with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>adacovex prove --target=. --force</code> under gnatprove 16.1.0 (<code"
       & ">--steps=10000</code>)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The Ada_CRDT dogfood target re-verified at Platinum, 589/589 VCs, 0"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "unproved, 0 justified.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""traceability""><a class=""header"" href=""#traceability"">Traceability</a"
       & "></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>No new HLRs. The quiet/suppression behaviour extends the existing <code>H"
       & "LR-CLI</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tag (<code>--quiet</code>, <code>--suppress-warnings=SETS</code> parsing in "
       & "<code>adacovex-config</code>) and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>HLR-PROVE</code> (<code>Replay_Suppressed</code> set-list filtering in"
       & " <code>adacovex-prove</code>),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "covered by the C1 config tests and the <code>make run-ada-crdt</code> dogfoo"
       & "d"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "regression. The CI <code>--verbose</code> wiring is covered by this project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Ada_CRDT"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s workflow files; see <code>docs/cli-reference.md</code> for the full flag"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "documentation.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                    </main>"
