       & ASCII.LF
       & "                        <h1 id=""adacovex-1230""><a class=""header"" href=""#adac"
       & "ovex-1230"">adacovex 1.23.0</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-24</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.22.0 -&gt; 1.23.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""changes""><a class=""header"" href=""#changes"">Changes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c1-dashboard-search-indexes-all-tab-content-and-restyled-as-button"">"
       & "<a class=""header"" href=""#c1-dashboard-search-indexes-all-tab-content-and-res"
       & "tyled-as-button"">C1: Dashboard search indexes all tab content and restyled a"
       & "s button</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The header search box now indexes <strong>full text content across every "
       & "tab</strong>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(Overview, Proof, Tests, Compliance, Dependencies, Charts) instead of only"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dependency names.  Search hits show a context snippet and a tab badge, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "clicking a hit navigates to the correct tab.  The search input is wrapped in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>.search-wrap</code> with a magnifying-glass icon and a clear button, s"
       & "tyled to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "match the existing <code>.theme-toggle</code> button family so it no longer "
       & "reads as a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "bare <code>&lt;input&gt;</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c2-compliance-status-shows-target-level-and-percentage-achieved""><a "
       & "class=""header"" href=""#c2-compliance-status-shows-target-level-and-percentage"
       & "-achieved"">C2: Compliance status shows target level and percentage achieved<"
       & "/a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Compliance tab now leads with a gauge that displays the <strong>targe"
       & "t level</strong>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(e.g. <code>Target: DAL-C</code>) and the <strong>achieved percentage</stron"
       & "g> (weighted average of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR traceability, tests passing, and SPARK level met).  The SVG arc reflects"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the actual percentage, and the breakdown (<code>HLR 85% / Tests 100% / SPARK"
       & " 100%</code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "is shown below the gauge.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c3-overview-tab-visualises-tests-with-column-chart""><a class=""header"
       & """ href=""#c3-overview-tab-visualises-tests-with-column-chart"">C3: Overview ta"
       & "b visualises tests with column chart</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Overview tab now includes a <strong>test category column chart</stron"
       & "g> alongside the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "existing collation cards.  Each category is a vertical bar proportional to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "its test count, with the raw number displayed below the label and colour-cod"
       & "ed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "by pass/fail status.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c4-charts-tab-adds-polar-ring-and-stacked-bar-for-dependency-scopes"""
       & "><a class=""header"" href=""#c4-charts-tab-adds-polar-ring-and-stacked-bar-for-"
       & "dependency-scopes"">C4: Charts tab adds polar ring and stacked bar for depend"
       & "ency scopes</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Charts tab now includes two new chart cards:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Dependencies by Scope</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a polar ring (conic-gradient pie with CSS"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "centre hole) coloured by base/dev/transitive/vendored, with a centre badge"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "showing the total dependency count.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Scope Breakdown</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a stacked horizontal bar with percentage labels and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "a legend showing raw counts per scope.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Both cards include raw numbers alongside the visual so the charts never f"
       & "eel"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "made up.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c5-dependency-tree-spacing-checkbox-size-and-icon-scale-fixed""><a cl"
       & "ass=""header"" href=""#c5-dependency-tree-spacing-checkbox-size-and-icon-scale-"
       & "fixed"">C5: Dependency tree spacing, checkbox size, and icon scale fixed</a><"
       & "/h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dependency tree nodes now have <code>margin: 8px 0</code> and <code>p"
       & "adding: 10px 14px</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "for comfortable reading.  The scope-filter checkboxes are larger (<code>18x1"
       & "8px</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>.box</code>) for better touch targets, and the inline SVG scope pictog"
       & "rams are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "scaled down to <code>10x10px</code> so they no longer dominate the label.</p"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c6-footer-simplified-and-credits-moved-to-dedicated-tab""><a class=""h"
       & "eader"" href=""#c6-footer-simplified-and-credits-moved-to-dedicated-tab"">C6: F"
       & "ooter simplified and credits moved to dedicated tab</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The footer is now a single centred line:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Generated by adacovex - Embed: ?theme=light|dark|system - Tabs: #proof"
       & "/#deps - API: /api/metrics - /api/deps</code></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The third-party credits table moved from the footer into the <strong>Cred"
       & "its</strong> tab,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "where it has room to breathe.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c7-docs-gaps-filled-for-non-api-workflows""><a class=""header"" href=""#"
       & "c7-docs-gaps-filled-for-non-api-workflows"">C7: Docs gaps filled for non-API "
       & "workflows</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>User-facing docs were expanded so common tasks no longer require reading "
       & "the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "API reference:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>docs/installation.md</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " quick-start section</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>docs/dashboard.md</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " per-tab walkthrough and chart legend</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>docs/sbom.md</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " when and why to generate an SBOM, how to read it</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>docs/standards.md</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " DO-178C / ISO 26262 / IEC 62304 in plain language</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>docs/vcs.md</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " when differential modes are useful and setup tips</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>docs/ci-cd.md</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " practical GitHub Actions and GitLab CI examples</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c8-cyclomatic-complexity-checker-ported-to-ada""><a class=""header"" hr"
       & "ef=""#c8-cyclomatic-complexity-checker-ported-to-ada"">C8: Cyclomatic complexi"
       & "ty checker ported to Ada</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code>covex complexity</code> subcommand now runs cyclomatic-complexi"
       & "ty analysis"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "directly inside the adacovex binary (previously a standalone Python script)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The checker scans <code>src/*.ads</code> and <code>src/*.adb</code>, attribu"
       & "tes decision points to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "top-level subprograms, and enforces the same gates as <code>tools/check-comp"
       & "lexity.py</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(max-file-loc, max-file-pct, max-fn-complexity, max-file-complexity).  Exit"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "code is 1 when any gate is violated.  <code>make complexity-check</code> now"
       & " invokes"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>./bin/adacovex complexity</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c9-dependency-detection-expanded-for-more-languages""><a class=""heade"
       & "r"" href=""#c9-dependency-detection-expanded-for-more-languages"">C9: Dependenc"
       & "y detection expanded for more languages</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>Discover_System_Dev_Deps</code> now scans source files for C/C++ (."
       & "c, .h, .cpp,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ".hpp, .cc, .cxx), Ruby (.rb), C# (.cs), Java (.java), Rust (.rs), Go (.go),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "JavaScript/TypeScript (.js, .mjs, .cjs, .ts, .mts, .cts), SCSS/CSS (.scss,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ".css), and Ada (.ads, .adb).  Package-manifest detection covers package.json"
       & ","
       & ASCII.LF
