       & "nit test round-trips the cache: a second discovery on the same fixture and c"
       & "ache dir agrees exactly with the first, including tools that are absent from"
       & " PATH.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c4-formal-containers-experiment-confirms-the-two-spark_mode-off-exce"
       & "ptions""><a class=""header"" href=""#c4-formal-containers-experiment-confirms-th"
       & "e-two-spark_mode-off-exceptions"">C4: Formal-containers experiment confirms t"
       & "he two SPARK_Mode Off exceptions</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code>Adacovex.Complexity</code> package was probed as a candidate fo"
