       & ASCII.LF
       & "SPARK-approved (formal) containers so its <code>SPARK_Mode (Off)</code> coul"
       & "d be"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "removed. Scratch units under gnatprove 16.1.0 show this is not viable:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>The GNAT 16.2.1 runtime formal containers"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>Ada. Containers. Formal_Vectors</code> and friends) are <code>pragma "
       & "Compile_Time_Error</code> stubs; the implementations moved to the SPARK libr"
       & "ary shipped inside the gnatprove toolchain (`SPARK. Containers.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Formal.*`).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
