       & "library, breaking the zero-dependency contract: gnatprove is resolved at"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "run time by the <code>prove</code> subcommand, but the containers would be a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "compile-time dependency.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>The <code>Complexity</code> aggregates embed vector components; the form"
