       & "book.  The tools unit tests grow from 41 to 48.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c6-dashboard-preview-screenshots-refreshed-and-api-tab-added""><a cla"
       & "ss=""header"" href=""#c6-dashboard-preview-screenshots-refreshed-and-api-tab-ad"
       & "ded"">C6: Dashboard preview screenshots refreshed and API tab added</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Charts tab preview (<code>docs/media/dashboard_preview_charts.png</co"
       & "de>) is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "regenerated from the live dashboard, and a new API tab preview"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>docs/media/dashboard_preview_api.png</code>) is captured and added to"
       & " the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dashboard walk-through in <code>docs/dashboard.md</code>. The walk-through n"
       & "ow covers"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "all eight tabs in header order, and the Charts tab description is corrected"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "from "
