       & "<p>Version bumped 1.8.0 -&gt; 1.9.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""changes""><a class=""header"" href=""#changes"">Changes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c1-honest-gnatprove-parse-across-gnatprove-v15v16""><a class=""header"""
       & " href=""#c1-honest-gnatprove-parse-across-gnatprove-v15v16"">C1: Honest GNATpr"
       & "ove parse across gnatprove v15/v16</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>Adacovex. Parsers. GNATprove</code> now reconciles the command-line"
       & " <code>Summary of SPARK analysis</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Total"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " row between gnatprove 15.x and 16.x: the row layout differs between version"
       & "s (the prover and unproved columns are centered and the "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Justified"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & "/"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Unproved"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " columns are blank (<code>.</code>) in one format and populated in the other"
       & "). A field-based reader (<code>Get_Column_Number</code>) extracts each colum"
       & "n by its padded column span instead of by "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "nth number in the line"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", so a justified-VC percentage that was mistaken for the unproved percentage"
       & " on the shared 15.x/16.x layout no longer corrupts the summary.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>This fixes the self-assessment: the previous "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Platinum / all VCs proved"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " report was a parser artifact that read the unproved column as zero. The hon"
       & "est level immediately after this fix was Silver; the proof fixes in C5 then "
       & "closed the real gap, so the self-assessment is genuinely Platinum again (see"
       & " Proof Results).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c2-global-gnatprove-version-pin-adacovextoml--env""><a class=""header"""
       & " href=""#c2-global-gnatprove-version-pin-adacovextoml--env"">C2: Global gnatpr"
       & "ove version pin (<code>adacovex.toml</code> / env)</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>covex prove</code> resolves <code>gnatprove</code> as: <strong>mani"
       & "fest pin &gt; global pin &gt; PATH &gt;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "cache &gt; download</strong>. A new global pin "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the <code>ADACOVEX_GNATPROVE_VERSION</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "environment variable or the <code>[prove] gnatprove-version = ""16.1.0""</code"
       & "> key in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>~/.adacovex/adacovex.toml</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " deploys the exact gnatprove binary crate"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "standalone via <code>alr -n get</code> and runs it directly, with the same"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "authoritative, never-fall-back semantics as a manifest pin. It applies only"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "to projects whose own manifest does not declare gnatprove (the manifest pin"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "always wins), so a single workstation/CI can fix every proof on one prover"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "without touching each project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s manifest. The provenance and the pin are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "folded into the proof result-cache identity, so proofs from different prover"
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "never mix.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c3-ci-threshold-gates---require-spark----require-docstrings----requi"
       & "re-tests----require-proof""><a class=""header"" href=""#c3-ci-threshold-gates---"
       & "require-spark----require-docstrings----require-tests----require-proof"">C3: C"
       & "I threshold gates (<code>--require-spark</code> / <code>--require-docstrings"
       & "</code> / <code>--require-tests</code> / <code>--require-proof</code>)</a></"
       & "h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Four <code>--require-*</code> flags add explicit minimum-bar checks on to"
       & "p of the DAL criteria. Off by default; when set, the assessment fails loudly"
       & " (exit code 1 with an explicit <code>CI GATE:</code> reason) if the target f"
       & "alls below the required level: <code>--require-spark=LVL</code> (Stone.. Pla"
       & "tinum), <code>--require-docstrings=PCT</code> and <code>--require-proof=PCT<"
       & "/code> (percent, 0-100), and <code>--require-tests=N</code> (passing test co"
       & "unt). The GitHub Action exposes matching <code>require-spark</code>, <code>r"
       & "equire-docstrings</code>, <code>require-tests</code>, and <code>require-proo"
       & "f</code> inputs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Because a stricter gnatprove can legitimately leave more VCs unproved, th"
       & "e gates are designed to be set against the results of the prover actually pi"
       & "nned.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c4-honest-sbom-proof-level""><a class=""header"" href=""#c4-honest-sbom-"
       & "proof-level"">C4: Honest SBOM proof level</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>Adacovex. Renderers. SBOM. Proof_Level_Property</code> now reports "
       & "the assessed level verbatim (<code>Stone</code>..<code>Platinum</code>) inst"
       & "ead of collapsing every non-Platinum result to <code>""Gold""</code>, so an SB"
       & "OM never overstates assurance (Silver with unproved VCs is reported as <code"
       & ">""Silver""</code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The proof-level postcondition was widened to the full range accordingly.<"
       & "/p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c5-proof-fixes-to-0-unproved-platinum-under-gnatprove-1610""><a class"
       & "=""header"" href=""#c5-proof-fixes-to-0-unproved-platinum-under-gnatprove-1610"""
       & ">C5: Proof fixes to 0 unproved (Platinum under gnatprove 16.1.0)</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Eliminated every unproved VC so the self-assessment reaches <strong>Plati"
       & "num</strong>:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<strong>343 VCs, 343 proved, 0 unproved</strong> across 38 analysed units un"
       & "der gnatprove"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "16.1.0, with no <code>SPARK_Mode(Off)</code> and no justified VCs. The bulk "
       & "of the debt"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "was solver step-limit timeouts, not genuine proof gaps; the rest needed real"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "contract and structure fixes:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>covex prove</code> now passes <code>--steps=5000</code> by default"
       & " (an explicit <code>--steps=</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "still wins), replacing gnatprove"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s low default step budget that reported"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "provers reached step limit"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " as unproved VCs. The CLI <code>--steps</code> default"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "stays <code>-1</code> so non-prove invocations are unaffected.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>Adacovex.Renderers.SBOM</code>: strengthened the <code>I2S</code>/"
       & "<code>Pad2</code> contracts with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Result'First</code>/<code>Result'Last</code> bounds; restructured the "
       & "ISO epoch year/month"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "loops behind explicit guards with a <code>Days_Remaining</code> loop invaria"
       & "nt; hoisted"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "per-iteration helper calls into constants; guarded <code>Dy + 1</code>; extr"
       & "acted the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "timestamp <code>&amp;</code> chain into an <code>Assemble_ISO</code> helper "
       & "with a tight <code>Pre</code>; and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "delegated the <code>Proof_Level_Property</code> postcondition to <code>Types"
       & ".To_String</code>.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>Adacovex.IR_Synthesiser</code>: narrowed the append cursor <code>R"
       & "Len</code> to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Natural range 0 .. Max_Pkg_Len</code> so the buffer write can never ov"
       & "erflow"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Natural'Last</code>.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>Adacovex.Parsers.Tests</code>: added a cursor-bound assert inside "
       & "the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>K &gt;= S'First</code> guard of <code>Number_Before_Word</code> so the"
       & " quantified digit-check"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "loop invariants can discharge their array-access checks.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The earlier "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "509 VCs / 168 unproved / Silver"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " figure is not reproducible by"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "any documented gnatprove invocation and was retired; see"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>docs/proof/16.1.0-ledger.md</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c6-manifest-declared-dependencies-registered-in-the-sbom-graph""><a c"
       & "lass=""header"" href=""#c6-manifest-declared-dependencies-registered-in-the-sbo"
       & "m-graph"">C6: Manifest-declared dependencies registered in the SBOM graph</a>"
       & "</h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>Adacovex. Parsers. Manifest. Build_Dependency_Graph</code> now regi"
       & "sters every dependency declared in the manifests even when no GPR <code>with"
       & "</code>-clause or <code>alire.lock</code> entry resolves it: base deps from "
       & "<code>alire.toml</code> (scope <code>base</code>) and dev deps from <code>al"
       & "ire-dev.toml</code> (scope <code>dev</code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Previously the manifest was parsed only to classify the scope of GPR/lock"
       & "-resolved components, so a zero-<code>with</code> project whose toolchain de"
       & "ps live solely in <code>alire-dev.toml</code> (e.g. adacovex itself: <code>g"
       & "natprove</code>, <code>gnatdoc_bin</code>, <code>gnatformat_bin</code>) prod"
       & "uced an SBOM with no dependency components. Unresolved manifest deps appear "
       & "name-only with a <code>pkg:alire/&lt;name&gt;</code> purl, exactly like GPR-"
       & "only deps.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c7-gnatprove-info-warning-cleanup""><a class=""header"" href=""#c7-gnatp"
       & "rove-info-warning-cleanup"">C7: GNATprove info-warning cleanup</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Removed the persistent <code>info:</code> noise from the standard prove r"
       & "un by making"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gnatprove analyse each flagged subprogram independently:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>Min_SPARK_For</code> and <code>Need_Tests</code> moved from the bo"
       & "dy of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Adacovex.Compliance.DAL</code> into the spec (public API with docstrin"
       & "gs), so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "they are no longer "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "only analysed in the context of calls"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ".</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>Starts_With</code> moved from the body of <code>Adacovex.Parsers.T"
       & "ests</code> into the spec,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dropping its in-context-analysis note.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The remaining in-context note (<code>Append</code>"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s nested loop in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Adacovex.IR_Synthesiser</code>) is left as-is: hoisting it to package "
       & "level to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "silence the note introduced unproved range-check VCs, so the benign message"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "was kept over worse proof debt.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""test-suite""><a class=""header"" href=""#test-suite"">Test Suite</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>368 tests (was 336 native + new cases). Added: gnatprove v15/v16 Total-ro"
       & "w"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "reconciliation cases (<code>Get_Column_Number</code>), CI-threshold default/"
       & "set checks in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>adacovex_config_tests</code> (the CLI gnatprove-version pin was remove"
       & "d), the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "honest SBOM proof-level mapping in <code>adacovex_sbom_tests</code>, and a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "both-manifests fixture in <code>adacovex_sbom_tests</code> verifying base/de"
       & "v manifest"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "deps are registered without GPR <code>with</code>-clauses or a lockfile.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""proof-results""><a class=""header"" href=""#proof-results"">Proof Results"
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Self-assessment reports <strong>Platinum</strong>: <strong>343 VCs, 343 p"
       & "roved, 0 unproved</strong> under"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gnatprove 16.1.0 across 38 analysed units (no justified VCs). gnatprove 16.1"
       & ".0"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "generates stricter overflow/counterexample checks than 15.x; after the C1"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "parser fix the honest level was Silver, and the C5 proof fixes (plus the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--steps=5000</code> default) then discharged every remaining VC. The i"
       & "nterim"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "509 VCs / 168 unproved / Silver"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " figure was a stale count that no documented"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gnatprove invocation reproduces. The CI gates"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>require-spark=Platinum</code>, <code>require-proof=100</code> in the "
       & "Makefile and workflows)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "match this state.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""traceability""><a class=""header"" href=""#traceability"">Traceability</a"
       & "></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>No new HLR tags were added. The changed packages are covered by the exist"
       & "ing"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tags:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>-- HLR-PROOF</code> on <code>Adacovex.Parsers.GNATprove</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " parser reconciliation.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>-- HLR-PROVE</code> on <code>Adacovex.Prove</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " global gnatprove pin + resolution order,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "default <code>--steps=5000</code> proof budget.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>-- HLR-CLI</code> on <code>Adacovex.Config</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code>--require-*</code> CI gates (CLI parsing).</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>-- HLR-SBOM</code> on <code>Adacovex.Renderers.SBOM</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " honest proof-level property,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "ISO epoch proof fixes.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>-- HLR-IR</code> on <code>Adacovex.IR_Synthesiser</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " bounded append-cursor fixes.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>-- HLR-TEST</code> on <code>Adacovex.Parsers.Tests</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " digit-scan cursor bound.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>-- HLR-MANIFEST</code> on <code>Adacovex.Parsers.Manifest</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " manifest-declared"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "base/dev deps registered in the SBOM dependency graph.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                    </main>"
