       & ASCII.LF
       & "                    <main>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                        <h1 id=""high-level-requirements--adacovex""><a class="
       & """header"" href=""#high-level-requirements--adacovex"">High-Level Requirements "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " adacovex</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""requirement-index""><a class=""header"" href=""#requirement-index"">Requi"
       & "rement Index</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-ARCH: Architecture and build system</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-CACHE: Result caching</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-CPU: Cross-platform CPU core detection</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-SCAN: Ada source scanning</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-PROOF: SPARK / GNATprove proof analysis</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-TEST: Test result parsing</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-COMPLIANCE: DO-178C compliance assessment (all DAL levels A-E)</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-DAL-A to E: Per-level DAL criteria (see below)</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-DAL-A: DAL-A criteria "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " all HLRs traced, no orphans, tests pass, Gold SPARK</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-DAL-B: DAL-B criteria "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " all HLRs traced, no orphans, tests pass, Silver SPARK</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-DAL-C: DAL-C criteria "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " all HLRs traced, no orphans, tests pass, Bronze SPARK</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-DAL-D: DAL-D criteria "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " all HLRs traced, tests pass</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-DAL-E: DAL-E criteria "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " all HLRs traced</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-RENDER-ANSI: ANSI terminal rendering</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-RENDER-SVG: SVG badge generation</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-RENDER-MD: Markdown report generation</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-RENDER-HTML: HTML dashboard and JSON API</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-SERVER: HTTP server</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-ANSI: Terminal colour support</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-TZ: Timezone resolution and local-time formatting</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-CLI: CLI argument parsing</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-COMPLEXITY: Cyclomatic complexity and LOC gating</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-DIFF: Differential assessment ("
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "compare-base)</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-METRICS: Docstring coverage metrics</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-MANIFEST: Alire manifest and dependency-graph parsing</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-PROVE: GNATprove subcommand</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-SBOM: Proof-aware SBOM generation</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>HLR-IR: IR type profiles, host/target config, and foreign type-name lowe"
       & "ring</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""requirements""><a class=""header"" href=""#requirements"">Requirements</a"
       & "></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-ARCH: The tool shall build with <code>alr build</code> and support Ma"
       & "kefile targets"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "for build, prove, fmt, lint, api-docs, changelog, and clean.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-CACHE: The tool shall cache per-file analysis results (source scans,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "GNATprove summaries, test summaries) on disk keyed by the SHA-256 hash of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "each analysed artifact, serve unchanged files from the cache instead of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "re-scanning / re-parsing / re-proving, evict oldest entries first when the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "configured cap is reached, and report cache hits, misses, and evictions;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "behaviour is controlled by <code>--cache</code> / <code>--no-cache</code> / "
       & "<code>--cache-dir</code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--cache-max</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-CPU: The tool shall detect the host logical CPU count across Linux,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "macOS, FreeBSD, and Windows using only the GNAT runtime (no external tools),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "detect CI environments, and resolve GNATprove parallelism: an auto default"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "that reserves two cores for system responsiveness on developer machines, all"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "cores inside CI, and explicit <code>-jN</code> overrides.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-SCAN: The tool shall recursively scan Ada source files, extract subpr"
       & "ogram"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "declarations, docstring annotations, and HLR traceability tags.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-PROOF: The tool shall parse GNATprove summary output and categorize"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "verification conditions (flow, run-time, assertions, contracts, termination)"
       & ".</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-TEST: The tool shall parse AUnit test results (Markdown or stdout) an"
       & "d"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "report total passed / failed test counts.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-COMPLIANCE: The tool shall assess DO-178C compliance for any DAL leve"
       & "l"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "A through E. Assessment criteria per level are defined in HLR-DAL-A through"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR-DAL-E and implemented in the compliance package.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-DAL-A: DAL-A assessment shall verify HLR trace coverage (all HLRs fou"
       & "nd"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "in source), no orphan tags, all tests passing, and minimum SPARK Gold level"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(all run-time checks proved, all assertions proved, all functional contracts"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proved, all termination proved).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-DAL-B: DAL-B assessment shall verify HLR trace coverage, no orphan ta"
       & "gs,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "all tests passing, and minimum SPARK Silver level (all run-time checks prove"
       & "d,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "all assertions proved, AoRTE-free).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-DAL-C: DAL-C assessment shall verify HLR trace coverage, no orphan ta"
       & "gs,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "all tests passing, and minimum SPARK Bronze level (flow analysis passes).</p"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-DAL-D: DAL-D assessment shall verify HLR trace coverage and all tests"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "passing. No SPARK proof requirement.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-DAL-E: DAL-E assessment shall verify HLR trace coverage only. No test"
       & " or"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proof requirements.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-RENDER-ANSI: The tool shall render a colour-annotated summary report "
       & "to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "standard output using ANSI escape codes.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-RENDER-SVG: The tool shall generate Shields.io-style SVG badges for"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "SPARK level, test status, and DO-178C compliance status.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-RENDER-MD: The tool shall generate Markdown verification reports"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(VERIFICATION.md) and traceability matrices (TRACE.md).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-RENDER-HTML: The tool shall generate a self-contained HTML dashboard"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "page and a JSON metrics API.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-SERVER: The tool shall serve the dashboard, API, and badge endpoints"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "via a built-in HTTP/1.1 server on a configurable port.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-ANSI: The tool shall colour its terminal output, and shall suppress"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "colour inside CI or when NO_COLOR is set.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-TZ: The tool shall resolve a display timezone from the operating"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "system or from a user timezone override, and format the current date and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "time in that zone.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-CLI: The tool shall accept CLI arguments in "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "key=value and "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "key value"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "forms with sensible defaults, and print usage help on "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "help.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-COMPLEXITY: The tool shall compute per-file and per-subprogram cyclom"
       & "atic"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "complexity for Ada source files and enforce configurable LOC and complexity"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gates (max file LOC, max file percentage of codebase, max function"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "complexity, max file complexity).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-DIFF: The tool shall support differential assessment via "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "compare-base,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "comparing the target at a git base ref against its current working tree and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "reporting deltas in docstring coverage, HLR traceability, SPARK proof level,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "test results, and DAL status.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-METRICS: The tool shall compute docstring coverage as a percentage of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "documented subprograms over total subprograms.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-MANIFEST: The tool shall resolve the project dependency graph from Al"
       & "ire"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "manifest files (alire.toml / alire-dev.toml), the alire.lock solved-crate"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "list, and GNAT project (.gpr) with clauses, deduplicating across sources.</p"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-SBOM: The tool shall generate proof-aware software bills of materials"
       & " in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "CycloneDX 1.5 and SPDX 2.3 JSON, extending the root component with the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex:proof_level and adacovex:dal_target properties and dependency"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "components with adacovex:proof_level = "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Not proved"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " (third-party"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dependencies are not proved by the tool).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>HLR-PROVE: The tool shall provide a <code>prove</code> subcommand that ru"
       & "ns GNATprove"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "against the target project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s root .gpr file. gnatprove is not a declared"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dependency of the tool; when the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
