       & "English.  The controlled Technical Names dictionary lives in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a href=""contributing/ste100-technical-names.html"">STE100 Technical Names</a"
       & ">.  Use it"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "before you use a technical word in any doc, docstring, or changelog.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""getting-started""><a class=""header"" href=""#getting-started"">Getting s"
