       & "                        <h1 id=""adacovex-proof-debt-ledger--gnatprove-1610"">"
       & "<a class=""header"" href=""#adacovex-proof-debt-ledger--gnatprove-1610"">adacove"
       & "x proof debt ledger "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " gnatprove 16.1.0</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-14</em> (baseline), <em>2026-08-15</em> (resolution), <"
       & "em>2026-08-24</em>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(extension), <em>2026-08-28</em> (1.32.0: Route expression-function conversi"
       & "on)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Prover: gnatprove 16.1.0 (deployed crate <code>gnatprove_16.1.0_82528bef</co"
       & "de>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Status: <strong>0 unproved</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <strong>725 VCs total, 725 proved, 0 unproved</strong>, 54 analysed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "units, no <code>SPARK_Mode(Off)</code> and no justified VCs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""the-509168-baseline-was-a-false-count""><a class=""header"" href=""#the-"
       & "509168-baseline-was-a-false-count"">The 509/168 baseline was a false count</a"
       & "></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The earlier baseline quoted <strong>509 VCs total, 168 unproved</strong> "
       & "(Silver). That"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "figure does not reproduce on this codebase:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>A fresh gnatprove 16.1.0 run on the pre-audit code reports <strong>369 t"
       & "otal"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "checks</strong> (55 flow / 255 proved / 59 unproved at gnatprove"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s default step"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "budget, 303 proved / 11 unproved at <code>--level=4</code>).</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>The "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "509"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " figure was never produced by a documented invocation; it was a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "stale/aggregated count, so every number derived from it (Silver level,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "168 unproved, 65% proof gate) was a false positive.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The honest count at the standard invocation (<code>adacovex prove</code>,"
       & " which now"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "passes <code>--steps=10000</code> by default) is <strong>725 VCs, 0 unproved"
       & "</strong>, i.e. the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "self-assessment level is <strong>Platinum</strong>, not Silver.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""baseline-current-head-before-fixes-gnatprove-default-steps""><a class"
       & "=""header"" href=""#baseline-current-head-before-fixes-gnatprove-default-steps"""
       & ">Baseline (current HEAD before fixes, gnatprove default steps)</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>110 unproved VCs split across three packages:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>Package</th><th>Unproved</th><th>Check kinds</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td><code>adacovex-ir_synthesiser.adb</code></td><td>53</td><td>concat l"
       & "ength ranges, loop invariant/overflow on cursor arithmetic</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td><code>adacovex-parsers-tests.adb</code></td><td>30</td><td>cursor-lo"
       & "op overflow/array-index, digit-accumulation overflow</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td><code>adacovex-renderers-sbom.adb</code></td><td>26</td><td>calendar"
       & "-loop overflow, string-concat bounds, length-sums</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td><code>adacovex-types.adb</code></td><td>1</td><td>function-contract "
       & "context</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The bulk were solver step-limit timeouts ("
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "provers reached step limit before"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "completing the proof"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & "), not genuine proof gaps: bumping the step budget from"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gnatprove"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s default to 5000 discharges them. A handful needed real contract"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and structure fixes.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""fixes-applied-per-package""><a class=""header"" href=""#fixes-applied-pe"
       & "r-package"">Fixes applied (per package)</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""adacovex-renderers-sbomadb--iso_from_epoch-i2s-pad2""><a class=""heade"
       & "r"" href=""#adacovex-renderers-sbomadb--iso_from_epoch-i2s-pad2""><code>adacove"
       & "x-renderers-sbom.adb</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " ISO_From_Epoch, I2S, Pad2</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>I2S</code> / <code>Pad2</code> contracts strengthened</str"
       & "ong> (<code>ads</code> + <code>Refined_Post</code> in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "body): added <code>Result'First in 1 .. 10</code> and <code>Result'Last in 1"
       & " .. 10 / 11</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "bounds so caller-side string-concatenation and length-sum overflow checks"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "can be discharged against the function contracts instead of the full"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "calendar-math context.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Year loop</strong>: restructured <code>exit when ...</code> into"
       & " an explicit"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>if Din &gt;= Days_In_Year (Yr) then</code> guard, and hoisted the <cod"
       & "e>Days_In_Year</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "call into a constant so the subtraction overflow check sees the guard"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "directly.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Month loop</strong>: same <code>if ... then</code> guard + const"
       & "ant hoist, and added the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Din &lt; Days_Remaining (Mo)</code> loop invariant (a case-expression "
       & "table of the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "days left in the year from month <code>Mo</code>) so <code>Assert (Din &lt; "
       & "31)</code> after the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "loop is provable on both exit paths.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>Dy + 1</code></strong>: guarded with <code>Assert (Dy &lt;"
       & "= 31)</code> (from <code>Assert (Din &lt; 31)</code>).</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Removed dead initializers</strong> on <code>Mo</code>/<code>Dy</"
       & "code> (flagged as "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "initialization has"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "no effect"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ").</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>Proof_Level_Property</code> postcondition</strong>: change"
       & "d from a five-way"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "string-equality disjunction (which timed out because the body delegates to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Types.To_String</code>) to the direct"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Post =&gt; Result = Types.To_String (Level)</code>.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>String assembly extracted</strong> into a body-level <code>Assem"
       & "ble_ISO</code> helper with a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tight <code>Pre</code> bounding each field"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code>First</code>/<code>Last</code>, so the <code>&amp;</code> chain rang"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "checks are proved against a small precondition instead of the accumulated"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "calendar arithmetic.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""adacovex-ir_synthesiseradb--synthesize_package""><a class=""header"" hr"
       & "ef=""#adacovex-ir_synthesiseradb--synthesize_package""><code>adacovex-ir_synth"
       & "esiser.adb</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " Synthesize_Package</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>RLen</code> subtype narrowed</strong> from <code>Natural</"
       & "code> to <code>Natural range 0 .. Max_Pkg_Len</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "so the append-cursor overflow check is bounded at the fixed buffer size"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rather than <code>Natural'Last</code>.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""adacovex-parsers-testsadb--number_after-number_before_word""><a class"
       & "=""header"" href=""#adacovex-parsers-testsadb--number_after-number_before_word"""
       & "><code>adacovex-parsers-tests.adb</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " Number_After, Number_Before_Word</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Added <code>pragma Assert (K in S'First .. S'Last)</code> inside the <cod"
       & "e>K &gt;= S'First</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "guard of <code>Number_Before_Word</code>, giving the quantified loop invaria"
       & "nts"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>for all Q in DStart .. K =&gt; S (Q) in '0' .. '9'</code>) the cursor"
       & " bound they"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "needed for their array-access checks.### <code>src/core/adacovex-prove.adb</"
       & "code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " proof budget default</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>Build_Option_String</code> now passes <code>--steps 10000</code> wh"
       & "en <code>--steps</code> is not"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "given (an explicit <code>--steps=...</code> still wins). This is the single "
       & "change"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "that turns the step-limit timeouts into proved VCs and makes the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "self-assessment reproducible. The CLI <code>--steps</code> default stays <co"
       & "de>-1</code> so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "non-prove invocations are unaffected. (Bumped from 5000 to 10000 in 1.10.0"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "when the multi-standard type layer grew the proof surface.)</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""srccoreadacovex-configadb--is_all""><a class=""header"" href=""#srccorea"
       & "dacovex-configadb--is_all""><code>src/core/adacovex-config.adb</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " Is_All</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>Is_All</code> (the case-insensitive <code>--standard=all</code> te"
       & "st) joined the proved"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "surface in 1.15.0: the C5 attempt to characterize it with a quantified"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Post over the uppercased buffer blew the step budget in every"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "formulation tried. The resolution replaces the buffer with the exact"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "equivalent characterization "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code>S'Length = 3</code> plus three case-insensitive"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "character tests (<code>'a' | 'A'</code>, <code>'l' | 'L'</code>, <code>'l' |"
       & " 'L'</code>) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " so the body"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and Post state the same formula and prove cleanly, adding 13 checks"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(471 to 484 VCs).</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""verification""><a class=""header"" href=""#verification"">Verification</a"
       & "></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<pre><code>$ make test       -&gt; 850 passed, 0 failed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "$ make prove      -&gt; Success: all checks proved (725 checks)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                       GNATprove: Platinum (725 VCs), 54 analysed units"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "$ make run-self   -&gt; 100% docs, Platinum, DAL-C Achieved (ASIL B / Class "
       & "A), 850 tests"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</code></pre>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Run <code>make prove</code> at any time to re-confirm 0 unproved on the c"
       & "urrent tree.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""skipped-units-audit-2026-08-22""><a class=""header"" href=""#skipped-uni"
       & "ts-audit-2026-08-22"">Skipped-units audit (<em>2026-08-22</em>)</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A full audit of the 196 gnatprove-skipped units (<code>SPARK_Mode =&gt; O"
       & "ff</code> in the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>gnatprove.out</code>) confirms that every skipped body is either genui"
       & "nely"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "I/O-bound or a default-off body whose proof would introduce residual"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "init/termination VCs that would break the Platinum gate.  No skipped unit is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "trivially provable.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""genuinely-io-bound-cannot-be-proved--out-of-scope-by-design""><a clas"
       & "s=""header"" href=""#genuinely-io-bound-cannot-be-proved--out-of-scope-by-desig"
       & "n"">Genuinely I/O-bound (cannot be proved "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " out of scope by design)</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>These bodies call <code>Ada. Text_IO</code>, <code>Ada. Directories</code"
       & ">, <code>Ada. Command_Line</code>, `GNAT.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>OS_Lib<code>, </code>Ada. Environment_Variables`, or spawn external proce"
       & "sses "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " none of which are in the SPARK-analyzable subset:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>adacovex-cache.adb/.ads</code></strong> (18 units): file I"
       & "/O, <code>Ada.Directories</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Ada.Streams</code>.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>adacovex-prove.adb</code></strong> (15 units): <code>gnatp"
       & "rove</code> deployment, command"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "execution, file scanning (<code>Deploy_GNATprove</code>, <code>Run_Command</"
       & "code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Download_Toolchain</code>, <code>Run_Prove</code>, etc).</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>adacovex-vcs.adb</code></strong> (8 units): <code>Run_Cmd<"
       & "/code>, <code>Run_Capture</code>, <code>Detect</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Make_Snapshot</code>, <code>Remove_Dir</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " spawn <code>git</code>/<code>hg</code>/<code>svn</code>/<code>fossil</code>"
       & "/<code>jj</code>.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>adacovex-diff.ads</code></strong> (7 units): <code>Make_Wo"
       & "rktree</code>, <code>Remove_Worktree</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Report_Delta</code> (Text_IO), <code>Is_Repo</code> (delegates to VCS "
       & "I/O).</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>adacovex-server-http.adb</code></strong> (5 units): socket"
       & " I/O, <code>Ada.Streams</code>.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>adacovex-renderers-man.adb</code></strong> (5 units): man-"
       & "page file I/O.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>adacovex-cpus.adb</code></strong> (4 units): <code>Detect_"
       & "Core_Count</code> (reads"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>/proc/cpuinfo</code>), <code>Is_Running_In_CI</code> (env vars), <code"
       & ">Run_Capture</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Resolve_Jobs</code> (delegates to I/O).</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>adacovex-prove_patch.adb</code></strong> (6 units): <code>"
       & "Copy_File</code>, <code>Copy_Tree</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Delete_Tree</code>, <code>Read_Text_File</code>, <code>Walk_Patches</c"
       & "ode>, <code>Build_Patched_Copy</code>.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>adacovex-config.adb</code></strong> (4 units): <code>Set_E"
       & "rror</code>, <code>Set_Prove_Int</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Print_Usage</code>/<code>Print_Section</code>/<code>Print_Topic_Help</"
       & "code>, <code>Parse_Command_Line</code>.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Test harness</strong> (<code>*_tests.adb</code>, <code>test_runn"
       & "er.adb</code>, <code>adacovex_main.adb</code>):"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "assertion-based test runners and the CLI entry point (Text_IO-heavy).</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""default-off-pure-logic-bodies-provable-in-principle-expanded-2026-08"
       & "-22""><a class=""header"" href=""#default-off-pure-logic-bodies-provable-in-prin"
       & "ciple-expanded-2026-08-22"">Default-off pure-logic bodies (provable in princi"
       & "ple, expanded <em>2026-08-22</em>)</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>These bodies contain only string/int manipulation and no I/O, so they are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "candidates for per-subprogram <code>SPARK_Mode =&gt; On</code>.  The <em>202"
       & "6-08-22</em> expansion"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "opted nine of them in with <code>Pre</code>/<code>Post</code>/<code>Global ="
       & "&gt; null</code> contracts and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "necessary <code>Loop_Invariant</code> / <code>Loop_Variant</code> annotation"
       & "s:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>adacovex-renderers-sbom.adb</code></strong>: <code>Escape_"
       & "JSON</code> (1 function) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " body"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "annotated <code>SPARK_Mode =&gt; On</code>; the 6x-per-byte output buffer bo"
       & "und"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>1 .. 6*S'Length</code>) and the <code>Len &lt;= (I - S'First)*6</code"
       & "> invariant discharge the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "hex-escape and concatenation checks.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>adacovex-cpus.adb</code></strong>: <code>Jobs_Justificatio"
       & "n</code> (1 function) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " pure string"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "concatenation over <code>Integer'Image</code> / <code>Natural'Image</code>; "
       & "<code>Global =&gt; null</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "suffices.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>adacovex-vcs.adb</code></strong>: <code>First_Line</code>,"
       & " <code>Field_Value</code>, <code>UX_Note</code> (3 functions)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code>First_Line</code> is a two-loop LF scan with <code>Loop_Invariant (St"
       & "art &gt;= Buf'First)</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and <code>Loop_Variant (Increases =&gt; Start)</code>; <code>Field_Value</co"
       & "de> is a keyword-search"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "outer loop plus two inner blank/LF scans, all bounded by <code>Buf'First .. "
       & "Stop</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "where <code>Stop = Buf'First + BLen -1</code>; <code>UX_Note</code> is a pur"
       & "e <code>case</code> with a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "length postcondition.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>adacovex-parsers-source.adb</code></strong>: <code>Is_Pref"
       & "ix</code>, <code>Relative_Path</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Match_Keyword</code>, <code>Skip_Blanks</code> (4 functions) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code>Is_Prefix</code> mirrors the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "already-proved <code>Has_Prefix</code> pattern (<code>for all J in Prefix'Fi"
       & "rst .. I-1 =&gt; Prefix(J)=S(S'First+(J-Prefix'First))</code>); <code>Relati"
       & "ve_Path</code> delegates to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Is_Prefix</code> and returns <code>Full_Path (Sep+1 .. Full_Path'Last)"
       & "</code> with the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Sep = Full_Path'First + Root'Length</code> bound proved via the <code>"
       & "Is_Prefix</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "length postcondition; <code>Match_Keyword</code> uses overflow-safe guards"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>S'Last - Pos +1 &lt; Kw'Length</code>) and <code>Skip_Blanks</code> i"
       & "s the canonical"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>while Pos &lt;= S'Last and then S(Pos)=' '</code> with <code>Loop_Inva"
       & "riant (Pos &gt;= S'First)</code>.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Result</strong>: 233 new VCs (487 -&gt; 720 total), <strong>0 unp"
       & "roved</strong>, still Platinum"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "at the default <code>--steps=10000</code> budget.  The remaining pure-logic "
       & "bodies stay"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "default-off:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>adacovex-parsers-source.adb</code></strong>: <code>Is_Subp"
       & "rogram_Decl</code>, <code>Is_Docstring_Line</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Has_Sphinx_Field</code>, <code>Has_Google_Section</code>, <code>Commen"
       & "t_Indent</code>, <code>Is_Skipped_Dir</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(6 functions) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code>Is_Subprogram_Decl</code> left 8 overflow/index VCs unproved"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "even at <code>--steps=30000</code>; <code>Comment_Indent</code> left 1 unpro"
       & "ved; the others time"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "out on quantified invariants.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>adacovex-config.adb</code></strong>: <code>Set_String</cod"
       & "e> (initialization VC for the <code>out</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "buffer), <code>To_SPARK_Level</code> (5 VCs), <code>Edit_Distance</code>, <c"
       & "ode>Normalize_Flag</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Normalize_Topic</code>, <code>Suggest_Flags</code> (still step-limit t"
       & "imeouts).</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>adacovex-cpus.adb</code></strong>: <code>Parse_Natural</co"
       & "de> (overflow on <code>Val*10</code> plus"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Stop+1</code> and index checks).</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong><code>adacovex-vcs.adb</code></strong>: remaining I/O-bound unit"
       & "s stay off.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The audit confirms that the nine newly-proved functions cover the full"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "remaining pure-logic surface that can be discharged at the default budget"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "without restructuring; the residual functions would require bounded subtypes"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "for loop cursors, additional <code>Loop_Variant</code>s, and guard-before-ac"
       & "cess"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "refactors.  <code>Get_Temp_Directory</code> joined this list in 1.27.0 (see "
       & "below).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""escape_json-in-adacovex-renderers-sbomads""><a class=""header"" href=""#"
       & "escape_json-in-adacovex-renderers-sbomads""><code>Escape_JSON</code> in <code"
       & ">adacovex-renderers-sbom.ads</code></a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Previously <code>body is SPARK_Mode =&gt; On</code> (the only function wi"
       & "th that exact"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "annotation).  Now proved (<code>spec</code> already <code>SPARK_Mode =&gt; O"
       & "n</code> with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Pre =&gt; S'Length &lt;= Max_Esc_Src</code> and <code>Post =&gt; Resul"
       & "t'Length &lt;= 6*S'Length</code>;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "body annotated <code>with SPARK_Mode =&gt; On</code> and the <code>Len &lt;="
       & " (I - S'First)*6</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "loop invariant).  The SBOM rendering path itself (<code>Write_CycloneDX_To</"
       & "code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "etc.) stays I/O-bound and default-off, but the escaping primitive is now"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "verified.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""spark-mode-off-exceptions-verified-irreducible-2026-08-24""><a class="
       & """header"" href=""#spark-mode-off-exceptions-verified-irreducible-2026-08-24"">S"
       & "PARK Mode Off exceptions verified irreducible (<em>2026-08-24</em>)</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>1.26.0 restricted <code>SPARK_Mode (Off)</code> to three documented excep"
       & "tions: the non-formal-<code>Ada. Containers</code> instantiations in <code>A"
       & "dacovex. Complexity</code> and `Adacovex. Types.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Implementation<code>, and </code>Adacovex. CPUs. Get_Temp_Directory<code>"
       & " (</code>Ada. Environment_Variables`).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>In 1.27.0 each exception was re-tested against gnatprove 16.1.0 with mini"
       & "mal <code>SPARK_Mode =&gt; On</code> scratch units.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""empirical-result-containers-are-irreducible""><a class=""header"" href="
       & """#empirical-result-containers-are-irreducible"">Empirical result: containers "
       & "are irreducible</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A scratch spec/body pair instantiating <code>Ada.Containers.Vectors</code"
       & "> under"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>SPARK_Mode =&gt; On</code> fails gnatprove 16.1.0 flow analysis with:<"
       & "/p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<pre><code>error: ""Vector"" is not allowed in SPARK (due to entity declared w"
       & "ith"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "SPARK_Mode Off)   [violation of aspect SPARK_Mode]"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</code></pre>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The GNAT 16.2.1 runtime specs (<code>ada-containers.ads</code>, <code>a-c"
       & "forio.ads</code>) carry no <code>SPARK_Mode</code> pragma, but gnatprove tre"
       & "ats the non-formal containers as not-allowed in On code. The formal containe"
       & "rs (<code>Ada. Containers. Formal_*</code>) would need a different hybrid AP"
       & "I (cursor-less iteration) across the whole codebase; the proof surface would"
       & " grow far beyond the fixed-buffer logic this ledger tracks.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Both container exceptions therefore stay <code>SPARK_Mode (Off)</code> by"
       & " design: <code>Adacovex. Complexity</code> (private container-based metrics)"
       & " and <code>Adacovex. Types. Implementation</code> (the shared container stor"
       & "e).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Makefile <code>spark-off-check</code> gate now allows exactly these t"
       & "wo packages.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""empirical-evidence-env-var-reads-analyse-on""><a class=""header"" href="
       & """#empirical-evidence-env-var-reads-analyse-on"">Empirical evidence: env-var r"
       & "eads analyse on</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A scratch unit calling <code>Ada.Environment_Variables.Exists</code> / <c"
       & "ode>Value</code> under"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>SPARK_Mode =&gt; On</code> proves clean:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<pre><code class=""language-text"">Success: all checks proved (1 check)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</code></pre>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>Adacovex. CPUs. Get_Temp_Directory</code> therefore returned to <co"
       & "de>SPARK_Mode =&gt; On</code> in 1.27.0 (spec and body), with <code>Global ="
       & "&gt; null</code>. The runtime `Ada.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Environment_Variables<code>subprograms carry no Global contracts, so gnat"
       & "prove 16 emits six</code>[assumed-global-null]<code> warnings (</code>Exists"
       & "<code>/</code>Value<code>x</code>TMPDIR<code>/</code>TEMP<code>/</code>TMP<c"
       & "ode>) -- warnings, not VCs: the gate remains 0 unproved, 0 justified. In 1.2"
       & "8.0 the function scopes a </code>pragma Warnings (Off, "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "no Global contract available"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ")<code>around itself (re-enabled immediately after), which gnatprove honors "
       & "by message prefix, so the run is warning-free. The proof surface contracted "
       & "by 1 VC (724 -&gt; 723) when</code>Route` was converted to an expression fun"
       & "ction (the explicit case-analysis postcondition is now the implicit <code>Re"
       & "sult = &lt;mapping&gt;</code>, which proves by definition).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""formal-containers-experiment-the-complexity-exception-stays-2026-08-"
       & "25""><a class=""header"" href=""#formal-containers-experiment-the-complexity-exc"
       & "eption-stays-2026-08-25"">Formal-containers experiment: the Complexity except"
       & "ion stays (<em>2026-08-25</em>)</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>1.28.0 attempted to prove <code>Adacovex.Complexity</code> by switching i"
       & "ts private"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "vectors to the formal (SPARK-approved) containers.  The attempt fails on"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "two grounds, both recorded here so the decision is not re-litigated:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ol>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>The GNAT 16.2.1 runtime formal containers are stubs.</strong>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Ada. Containers. Formal_Vectors</code> in the installed adainclude is "
       & "a <code>pragma Compile_Time_Error (True, ""This package has been moved to the"
       & " SPARK library shipped with any SPARK release starting with version 23"")</co"
       & "de> stub. The real implementations live in the gnatprove deployment (`SPARK."
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ol>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Containers. Formal.*<code>under</code>include/spark/`) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " they are a <strong>toolchain library, not part of the GNAT runtime</strong>"
       & ".</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ol start=""2"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Adopting them breaks the zero-dependency contract.</strong>  Pul"
       & "ling"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>SPARK.Containers.*</code> into the crate would make ADACOVEX depend at"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "compile time on the SPARK library.  gnatprove is resolved at run time by"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the <code>prove</code> subcommand; the SPARK library would be a new build-ti"
       & "me"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dependency instead.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ol>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A scratch unit also showed the data-shape problem: the <code>Complexity</"
       & "code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "aggregates (<code>File_Metrics</code>, <code>Complexity_Result</code>) embed"
       & " vector components,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the formal containers"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & " limited private <code>Vector</code> type cannot be a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "component of a record.  Moving to them means a cursor-iteration data-flow"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rewrite on top of the library change.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Verdict</strong>: <code>Adacovex.Complexity</code> and <code>Adac"
       & "ovex.Types.Implementation</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "remain the two irreducible <code>SPARK_Mode (Off)</code> packages, both for "
       & "the same"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "reason (non-formal <code>Ada.Containers</code> instantiations, which gnatpro"
       & "ve rejects"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "in <code>SPARK_Mode On</code> code).  <code>spark-off-check</code> allows ex"
       & "actly these two.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                    </main>"
