       & " Traceability"",""id"":""1139"",""title"":""Traceability""},""114"":{""body"":""Lightweigh"
       & "t docstring-coverage gate for PR-style CI checks. It scans sources, patches,"
       & " and computes docstring metrics on a base revision and the current tree. It "
       & "does not use GNATprove, tests, or DAL. Thus it works when the base does not "
       & "commit build artifacts. It prints a compact coverage table and a machine-par"
       & "seable coverage_delta: line. Then it cleans up the snapshot. Exit 0 if the c"
       & "urrent docstring coverage is >= the base. Exit 0 also if the base has no sou"
       & "rces. Exit 1 if coverage regressed. This mode is mutually exclusive with --c"
