       & " adacovex 1.7.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Changes"",""id"":""1156"",""title"":""Changes""},""1157"":{""body"":""A physical line lon"
       & "ger than Max_Line (262144 bytes on 64-bit) was previously\\nsilently truncat"
       & "ed by the source scanner: the tail of the line was drained and\\ndiscarded, "
       & "and the remaining (partial) line was parsed as if it were the whole\\nline. "
       & "GNATprove, test-result, HLR/LLR, and manifest parsers had a related bug\\n"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a full buffer was drained for the next physical line, misreading the\\nfoll"
       & "owing content. Both behaviours could silently produce wrong metrics. All par"
       & "sers now share an overflow-aware Read_Line helper on the Adacovex.Parsers pa"
       & "rent package: Exact detection. A line that fills the buffer exactly (end-of-"
       & "line\\nreached) parses normally. A line that genuinely exceeds the buffer is"
       & "\\ndetected via End_Of_Line, drained, and reported to stderr as Error: <path"
       & ">:<line>: line exceeds Max_Line buffer (<N> bytes). Explicit failure, never "
       & "partial output. The scanner stops parsing the\\noffending file (no partial A"
       & "ST), and the GNATprove / test-result / HLR/LLR\\nparsers clear their output "
       & "and fail. The manifest, lockfile, and GPR\\nparsers abort dependency-graph r"
       & "esolution. DAL is forced Unmet. Scan_Project returns a new Skipped_Ct; when "
       & "any\\nsource file is skipped, the assessment appends \\""N source file(s) ski"
       & "pped: line exceeds Max_Line\\"" to the DAL failure reasons, sets the status t"
       & "o Unmet, and exits 1 "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " no compliance claim can be made for unread code. Paths over Max_Path are re"
       & "ported and skipped instead of raising Constraint_Error; Push_Dir warns on ov"
       & "er-long directory paths rather\\nthan silently dropping them. Differential m"
       & "odes. --compare-base and --coverage-delta gain a Skipped field; a current tr"
       & "ee with skipped sources is always a\\nregression, and the diff reports sourc"
       & "es skipped. Auto-SBOM exit-code fix. The automatic SBOM emission no longer r"
       & "esets\\nthe assessment exit code to 0 on success (it now never touches Exit_"
       & "St),\\nso a DAL failure is reported correctly even when an SBOM is written."""
       & ",""breadcrumbs"":""Changelogs "
