       & "=0 forwards -j0 (all cores); --jobs=12 pins 12. --level=N (0-4), --timeout=N"
       & " (s), --steps=N, --memlimit=N (MB):\\nforwarded only when configured, leavin"
       & "g the tool defaults otherwise. -f / --force, --no-loop-unrolling, --no-inlin"
       & "ing: mapped to the\\ncorresponding GNATprove switches. Works across all thre"
