       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Changes"",""id"":""1166"",""title"":""Changes""},""1167"":{""body"":""The whole SPARK-on "
       & "codebase is now fully machine-proved. Previously only the\\nbounded IR types"
       & " ( Checked_Add32/64, IR_Bounds.Add32/64) carried complete\\nproofs; every ot"
       & "her SPARK unit was analysed but not fully discharged. Now all 491 VCs prove "
       & "with --prover=z3 --timeout=20, including the run-time\\nrange checks, assert"
       & "ions, functional contracts, and loop termination: Renderers: I2S (fixed 10**"
       & "Pos overflow by replacing exponentiation\\nwith a constant Pow10 power table"
       & ", loop invariants carrying the digit\\ncount and value bound, Buf initialize"
       & "d), Pad2 and Escape_JSON\\n(uninitialized-buffer fixes via (others => \' \')"
       & "), and ISO_From_Epoch\\n(chained & concatenation upper-bound proofs replaced"
       & " by a bounded Field-copy buffer procedure). Postconditions now document the "
       & "result\\nlengths ( I2S\'Result\'Length in 1 .. 10, Pad2\'Result\'Length in 1"
       & " .. 11). Parsers: Trim, Trim_Left, Number_After, and Number_Before_Word\\nga"
       & "ined Pre => S\'First >= 1 and S\'Last < Natural\'Last preconditions plus\\ns"
       & "trengthened loop invariants (carried array-index bounds and the digit-run\\n"
       & "range for all Q in DStart .. K => S (Q) in \'0\' .. \'9\'). IR synthesiser: "
       & "Bits, IR_Type_Name ( Post => \'Result\'Length <= 9), Lower_Type_Name, and Sy"
       & "nthesize_Package (buffer bounds, Sub/ Result\\ninitialization, and J >= I fo"
       & "r the outer-loop variant) all proved. Termination: every while loop across t"
       & "he codebase now carries an\\nexplicit Loop_Variant (increasing or decreasing"
       & " bound), so the implicit Always_Terminates aspects discharge "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " no loop is left as potentially\\nnon-terminating. The self-assessment is no"
       & "w: 26 packages, 59 subprograms, 100% docstrings, Platinum (500/500 VCs, 0 un"
       & "proved), 295/295 tests, DAL-C Achieved."",""breadcrumbs"":""Changelogs "
       & Character'Val(194)
