       & Character'Val(187)
       & " C1: Full SPARK proof coverage (Platinum, 0 unproved)"",""id"":""1167"",""title"":"""
       & "C1: Full SPARK proof coverage (Platinum, 0 unproved)""},""1168"":{""body"":""Fixed"
       & "-size buffers and the IR host model are now derived from the actual host\\nw"
       & "ord size instead of being hard-coded to 64-bit assumptions: Adacovex.Types.H"
       & "ost_Word_Bits : constant := System.Word_Size; the Max_Path / Max_Line path a"
       & "nd line buffers scale with it\\n( 64 * Host_Word_Bits = 4096, 4096 * Host_Wo"
       & "rd_Bits = 262144 on a 64-bit\\nhost), so builds on narrower hosts use propor"
       & "tionally smaller limits. The\\nsemantic limits ( Max_Id_Str, Max_Desc_Str, M"
       & "ax_Filename) stay fixed. Adacovex.Target_Profiles.Host_Word_Size auto-detect"
       & "s the host word size\\n(8/16/32/64) from the Ada runtime for Target_Config.H"
