       & " Acknowledgments"",""id"":""1289"",""title"":""Acknowledgments""},""129"":{""body"":""The "
       & "release workflow builds the binary from the vX. Y. Z tag. It bundles that ve"
       & "rsion into the binary. The action"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s build step sets ADACOVEX_VERSION (from github.ref_name). It regenerates sr"
       & "c/adacovex_version_info.ads before alr build. The shipped adacovex --version"
       & " reports exactly the tag. The download step of the published action verifies"
       & " this with adacovex --version after unpacking the release bundle. Maintainer"
       & "s reproduce the\\nrelease locally with make release VERSION=x.y.z (see the d"
       & "eveloper guide); a normal source build\\nreads the version from alire-dev.to"
       & "ml instead."",""breadcrumbs"":""adacovex CI/CD "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Release version bundling"",""id"":""129"",""title"":""Release version bundling""},""1"
       & "3"":{""body"":""adacovex assesses an Ada/SPARK project. The target root can be t"
       & "he repository root or a subdirectory (via --target=PATH). For a meaningful r"
       & "eport, the target must provide the items that follow. Any missing item shows"
       & " as N/A. DAL checks that depend on the missing item report Unmet."",""breadcru"
       & "mbs"":""Target project requirements "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Target project requirements"",""id"":""13"",""title"":""Target project requirements"
       & """},""130"":{""body"":""Gate every pull request so docstring coverage does not reg"
       & "ress against the\\nbase branch. This is exactly what --coverage-delta was bu"
       & "ilt for: # .github/workflows/pr-check.yml\\non: pull_request:\\njobs: covera"
       & "ge-delta: runs-on: ubuntu-latest steps: - uses: actions/checkout@v7 with: fe"
       & "tch-depth: 0 - uses: bladeacer/adacovex@v1 with: target: . standard: all cov"
       & "erage-delta: ${{ github.event.pull_request.base.sha }} The action exits non-"
       & "zero when coverage drops, failing the check. This\\nworkflow ships in the re"
       & "po at .github/workflows/pr-check.yml."",""breadcrumbs"":""adacovex CI/CD "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " PR coverage gate"",""id"":""130"",""title"":""PR coverage gate""},""131"":{""body"":""Eve"
       & "ry vX. Y. Z tag triggers .github/workflows/release.yml. The workflow calls t"
       & "he composite action with build, release-build, and prove. It builds the rele"
       & "ase binary, runs GNATprove, and validates the self-assessment. Then it packa"
       & "ges and publishes: adacovex-vX.Y.Z.tar.gz "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the version-matched binary ( adacovex plus the covex alias). The action dow"
       & "nloads this asset for the tag it is referenced\\nby, so @v1.9.0 runs adacove"
       & "x v1.9.0. adacovex-action-vX.Y.Z.tar.gz "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a copy of the composite action itself for\\nvendoring or air-gapped use. Bo"
       & "th bundles are attested with actions/attest\\non every tag. OIDC attestation"
       & "s appear under the release"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s attestations tab.\\nThe release notes link the signed attestation via the "
       & "action"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s attestation-url output. They also link a Git Changelog compare link\\n( co"
       & "mpare/v1.9.0...v1.14.0) and the human-readable changelogs. Changelog listing"
       & ". The Create GitHub Release step derives the changelog\\nlist from the avail"
