       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s manifest. The pinned gnatprove crate is\\ndeployed via alr -n get gnatprov"
       & "e=<version>. It is run directly, with no alr exec over the whole workspace. "
       & "For the command to succeed in a clean checkout or on CI, the consumer"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s\\nmanifests must follow two rules: alire.toml must be the clean publishing"
