       & " \\""*\\""). It must never be pinned to a local path such as covex = { path = "
       & "\\""../adacovex\\"" }. A path pin resolves only on the machine\\nthat has the "
       & "sibling checkout. In a consumer workspace or on CI, Alire\\nfails the whole "
       & "workspace load with a confusing error. This happens before\\nadacovex or alr"
       & " runs: ERROR: Failed to load alire.toml:\\nERROR: pins:\\nERROR: covex:\\nER"
       & "ROR: Pin path is not a valid directory: /home/runner/work/<repo>/<repo>/../a"
       & "dacovex If you see that, drop the covex path pin. Use covex = \\""*\\"". Strip"
       & " the dev\\ndeps and pins out of alire.toml. Keep them only in alire-dev.toml"
       & ". The Makefile pattern in many projects keeps the published alire.toml clean"
       & ".\\nIt swaps alire-dev.toml over alire.toml only for the duration of a prove"
       & "/ fmt/ doc target, then restores it. This gives local tooling the dev\\ndeps"
