       & "guide, CLI reference, standards, and more) The execution pipeline ( adacovex"
       & "_main.adb) is the spine of the tool: parse CLI -> scan .ads sources -> apply"
       & " docstring patches -> compute doc metrics\\n-> parse gnatprove.out -> parse "
       & "test results -> assess DAL -> render ANSI report\\n-> emit SVG badges -> emi"
       & "t Markdown reports -> emit SBOM -> serve dashboard (if --serve)\\n-> exit co"
       & "de (0 = Achieved) A handful of modes exit before the pipeline: --help, --ver"
