       & """:""adacovex supports multiple output formats: ANSI terminal report: Colour-c"
       & "oded summary for interactive use.\\nColour is suppressed under CI, NO_COLOR,"
       & " or TERM=dumb, so CI logs\\nstay plain (see Adacovex.Ansi and its pure decis"
       & "ion function Colour_Allowed) SVG badges: spark.svg, tests.svg, docs.svg, plu"
       & "s do178c.svg / iso26262.svg / iec62304.svg compliance badges ( --standard=al"
       & "l emits all\\nthree) for CI badges Markdown reports: VERIFICATION.md and TRA"
       & "CE.md for compliance documentation HTML dashboard: Interactive web dashboard"
       & " with JSON API ( --serve).\\nIt is standard-aware (defaults to all standards"
       & " like sbom) with light/dark\\ntheme support (toggle button, respects prefers"
       & "-color-scheme). The static\\npage shell (CSS, header, theme script) is a rea"
       & "l HTML file, resources/dashboard.html, bundled into the binary at build time"
       & ". tools/gen-dashboard.py assembles the authored CSS ( resources/css/dashboar"
       & "d.css),\\nthe authored JS ( resources/js/*.js), and the vendored JavaScript\"
       & "\nlibraries at the resources/ root ( graphre.js, nomnoml.js, flexsearch.js, "
       & "yace.js) into a single minified page shell. The layout\\nseparates dependenc"
       & "y JavaScript ( resources/ root) from authored dashboard\\nJavaScript ( resou"
       & "rces/js/), which is also how the SBOM asset scanner\\ntells vendored compone"
       & "nts from the project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own modules. The tool regenerates src/adacovex-dashboard_template.ads (a S"
       & "tring\\nconstant, committed and byte-identical when unchanged). The Ada comp"
       & "iler includes that constant in the final binary. Every released\\nbinary - w"
       & "hether a GitHub release artifact or an Alire crate binary - carries\\nthe co"
       & "mplete dashboard with no external file dependencies. At runtime, Adacovex.Re"
       & "nderers.HTML.Render_Dashboard_Internal only builds\\nthe dynamic card markup"
       & " and injects it at the __CARDS__ placeholder, filling\\nthe __THEME__ initia"
       & "l-theme marker. The result is a single self-contained\\nHTML document: no CD"
       & "N, no network requests, works offline. SBOM: CycloneDX 1.5, SPDX 2.3, or Mar"
       & "kdown format with proof, standard,\\nand DAL/level properties"",""breadcrumbs"""
       & ":""adacovex Architecture Decisions "
