       & "ier Names""},""217"":{""body"":""This page collects everything about how AI toolin"
       & "g is used in the adacovex\\nproject: the disclosure, why the code is trustwo"
       & "rthy despite AI assistance, how\\nLLM agents are expected to work on the cod"
       & "ebase, and the honest limits of\\nmachine-generated code."",""breadcrumbs"":""AI"
