       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Supported Tags"",""id"":""273"",""title"":""Supported Tags""},""274"":{""body"":""Prefix:"
       & " -- (two dashes + two spaces) for all doc lines. The single-space -- and tab"
       & "-separated ( --<TAB>) comment styles are also recognised, so\\ngenerated or "
       & "third-party code using those conventions counts toward coverage.\\nA bare --"
       & " or --- (divider) line is not a docstring. Summary first, then tag lines, th"
       & "en declaration "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " no blank lines. Descriptions capitalized, end with period. Two spaces betwe"
       & "en tag name and description (alignment padding). A plain summary line ( -- D"
