       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Stone"",""id"":""294"",""title"":""Stone""},""295"":{""body"":""Criterion Requirement Dat"
       & "a-flow analysis Every variable is assigned before use, no uninitialized read"
       & "s Information-flow analysis Depends/Global contracts match actual data depen"
       & "dencies Initialization checks All objects initialized before first use Enfor"
       & "cement gnatprove --mode=flow passes with 0 flow/initialization errors"",""brea"
       & "dcrumbs"":""API reference "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " SPARK Assurance Levels "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Bronze"",""id"":""295"",""title"":""Bronze""},""296"":{""body"":""Criterion Requirement A"
       & "bsence of run-time errors (AoRTE) All run-time checks proved: index bounds, "
       & "overflow, division-by-zero, etc. Assertions proved All user-specified pragma"
       & " Assert and pre/postcondition checks discharged Enforcement gnatprove --mode"
       & "=check reports 0 unproved run-time checks Justification Unproved checks may "
       & "be justified with pragma Annotate (limited to false positives)"",""breadcrumbs"
       & """:""API reference "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " SPARK Assurance Levels "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Silver"",""id"":""296"",""title"":""Silver""},""297"":{""body"":""Criterion Requirement F"
