       & "ant Core invariants Critical type/system properties specified and verified E"
       & "nforcement gnatprove --mode=prove reports 0 unproved functional contracts Co"
       & "verage At minimum: all public subprograms in core packages have postconditio"
       & "ns"",""breadcrumbs"":""API reference "
