       & "n.T) return Standard.String""},""346"":{""body"":""Content-addressed result cache "
       & "for adacovex.\\nThe cache stores arbitrary small blobs keyed by the SHA-256 "
       & "of their input\\n(a source file"
       & Character'Val(226)
