       & "ived from the inputs. An unchanged input always hits the\\nsame cache entry."
       & " Re-running adacovex on unchanged code serves results\\nstraight from disk. "
       & "There is no re-scan, no re-parse, and (for gnatprove)\\nno re-proof. The sto"
       & "re is split per input. Every analysed unit is cached under its own\\nkey. A "
       & "one-line change only invalidates that unit"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s entry and rewrites a\\nsingle tiny blob. Every other unit is served from c"
       & "ache unchanged. Storage is a two-level directory tree ( <cache>/<aa>/<aabb.."
       & ".>). A large\\nproject never creates a single directory with millions of ent"
       & "ries. Entries\\nare evicted oldest-first once the count exceeds a soft cap. "
       & "Disk usage\\nstays bounded without external dependencies (pure GNAT runtime "
       & "only).\\nHLR-CACHE: Result caching See also: Architecture "
       & Character'Val(226)
