       & "al; Overflow : Standard.Boolean)"",""id"":""495"",""title"":""procedure Read_Line (F"
       & " : Ada.Text_IO.File_Type; File_Path : Standard.String; Line_Num : Standard.N"
       & "atural; Line : Standard.String; Last : Standard.Natural; Overflow : Standard"
       & ".Boolean)""},""496"":{""body"":""GNATprove runner for the adacovex prove subcomman"
       & "d.\\nIt resolves a gnatprove executable. It runs it against a target\\nproje"
       & "ct"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s root .gpr file. It leaves a fresh obj/gnatprove/gnatprove.out\\nfor the st"
       & "andard assessment pipeline to parse. Resolution priority (lightweight: adaco"
       & "vex only requires alr on PATH): #. If the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s alire.toml or alire-dev.toml declares gnatprove as\\na dependency, deploy "
       & "only the gnatprove binary crate. This crate is\\na self-contained bundle wit"
       & "h no dependencies. Deploy it into\\n~/.adacovex/toolchain via alr -n get gna"
       & "tprove=<version>, then run\\nit directly. This avoids the fragile alr exec p"
       & "ath. That path\\nused to compose the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s entire dev-manifest dependency set\\n(covex, gnatdoc_bin, gnatformat_bin, "
       & "and more). Flaky third-party\\ndownloads in CI cannot fail a proof run. No d"
       & "ev-manifest swap is\\never needed. The manifest can declare the version as a"
       & " rich set\\nexpression ( ^15.1.0, ~15.1.0, and more). The leading operator i"
       & "s\\nstripped to yield the bare version that alr accepts. A\\nmanifest-declar"
       & "ed prover is authoritative. When it cannot be\\ndeployed, the run fails inst"
       & "ead of falling back. A different\\ngnatprove version can change which VCs ar"
       & "e discharged. Results must\\nalways come from the pinned prover. Priorities "
       & "2 to 5 apply only to\\nprojects whose manifest does not declare gnatprove. #"
       & ". A gnatprove version pinned globally. The pin comes from the\\nADACOVEX_GNA"
       & "TPROVE_VERSION environment variable or the [prove] gnatprove-version = \\""16"
       & ".1.0\\"" key in\\n~/.adacovex/adacovex.toml. Run_Prove reads it and passes it"
       & " in as\\nPinned_Version. The exact version is deployed via alr -n get gnatpr"
       & "ove=<version> and run directly. Like the manifest\\npin, it is authoritative"
       & ". A failure to deploy is a failure to run.\\nIt is folded into the proof res"
       & "ult-cache identity. A different pinned\\nversion can never reuse a stale pro"
       & "of. #. A gnatprove already on $PATH. #. A cached gnatprove in ~/.adacovex/to"
       & "olchain/bin (download layout) or a\\npreviously alr get-deployed gnatprove_*"
       & "/ crate under the same dir. #. Last resort: a platform toolchain download. I"
       & "t uses curl. It is\\nused only when no deployable, on-PATH, or cached gnatpr"
       & "ove is\\navailable. So the order is: manifest pin > global pin (config/env) "
       & "> PATH > cache >\\ndownload.\\nHLR-PROVE: GNATprove subcommand See also: Arc"
       & "hitecture "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " toolchain resolution Note: All items in this package are public."",""breadcru"
