       & "tatus_Metrics (Target_Dir : Standard.String; TZ_Spec : Standard.String; Succ"
       & "ess : Standard.Boolean)""},""509"":{""body"":""Proof patches for vendored dependen"
       & "cies. The docstring patch system (Adacovex.Parsers.Source.Apply_Patches)\\no"
       & "verlays documentation onto vendored .ads files. This package extends\\nthe s"
       & "ame .adacovex/patches/<relative-path> layout with SPARK proof\\nsupport. A p"
       & "atch file can carry SPARK aspects. The aspects are\\nSPARK_Mode on the packa"
       & "ge declaration and Pre, Post, or SPARK_Mode on\\nsubprogram declarations. Th"
       & "e prove subcommand merges them into a copy\\nof the vendored spec. When the "
       & "patch carries one, it also merges the\\nvendored body. GNATprove then analys"
       & "es the vendored unit with the\\npatched contracts. It does not modify the or"
       & "iginal vendored sources.\\nA .ads patch re-declares the spec with contracts."
       & " A .adb patch opts\\nthe body into the proof. The body is analysed only when"
       & " it declares\\nSPARK_Mode On itself. The merge is textual and line-based. Th"
       & "e patched source is the original\\nwith each patched subprogram declaration "
       & "replaced by the patch"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s\\ndeclaration block. The block carries the aspects. A declaration\\nmatche"
       & "s on name and normalised parameter profile. An overload patches\\nits exact "
       & "signature, never a same-named sibling. The default in mode\\nis equivalent t"
       & "o a bare mode. in out and out are distinct. The\\npackage declaration is giv"
       & "en the patch"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s package-level aspect when\\npresent. Subprogram declarations terminate at "
       & "the "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(152)
       & ";"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & " of a spec\\ndeclaration or at the is of a body declaration. A patched body\"
       & "\ndeclaration is replaced without touching the body proper. When the vendore"
       & "d body is SPARK-clean and opted in via a body patch,\\nGNATprove proves the "
       & "patched contracts. When it is not, for example\\nAda.Text_IO callers, GNATpr"
       & "ove skips the I/O bodies by design. The\\nunit is then reported as out of pr"
       & "oof scope. A proof patch never drags\\nthe target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s proof level down.\\nHLR-PROVE: GNATprove runner and proof patches Note: Al"
       & "l items in this package are public."",""breadcrumbs"":""API reference "
