       & ",""id"":""595"",""title"":""function Host_Word_Size return Adacovex.Target_Profiles"
       & ".Word_Size [Global]""},""596"":{""body"":""Timezone resolution and local-time form"
       & "atting for adacovex. adacovex respects the operating system"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s timezone by default. Users can\\noverride it for a single invocation with "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "tz / "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "timezone. Accepted\\nforms are a well-known IANA zone name (for example "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Asia/Singapore"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ") or a\\nfixed UTC/GMT offset ("
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "UTC+8"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "GMT+8"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "UTC+08"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "GMT+08"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "UTC+08:30"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & "). The crate has no library dependencies, so it ships no timezone database.\"
       & "\nA named zone resolves from a built-in table of common IANA names and\\nthe"
       & "ir standard-time (non-DST) offsets. A zone that may observe daylight\\nsavin"
       & "g time (and any zone the table lacks) is probed against the\\nplatform tzdat"
       & "a "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " zdump + date +%z on Linux/WSL "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " for the\\nDST-correct current offset; the table offset is the fallback when"
       & " the\\nprobe is unavailable. The system default offset comes from the standa"
       & "rd\\nAda runtime (Ada.Calendar.Time_Zones.UTC_Time_Offset), which honours th"
       & "e\\nTZ environment variable and the operating system"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s local timezone, so\\nthe default is always the operator"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s wall-clock timezone.\\nHLR-TZ: Timezone resolution and local-time formatti"
       & "ng Note: All items in this package are public."",""breadcrumbs"":""API reference"
       & " "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Adacovex.Timezones "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Adacovex.Timezones"",""id"":""596"",""title"":""Adacovex.Timezones""},""597"":{""body"":"
       & """"",""breadcrumbs"":""API reference "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Adacovex.Timezones "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Types"",""id"":""597"",""title"":""Types""},""598"":{""body"":""type Timezone_Info is rec"
       & "ord\\nDisplay : String (1 .. Max_TZ_Name);\\nDisplay_Len : Natural := 0;\\nO"
       & "ffset_Secs : Integer := 0;\\nIs_Named : Boolean := False;\\nResult_Valid : B"
