       & "alr install covex gnatprove && export PATH=\\""$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\\"" Asse"
       & "ss your project: adacovex --target=. --dal=C Serve the dashboard: adacovex -"
       & "-target=. --serve --port=8080 That is all you need for a local compliance as"
       & "sessment. For CI or release\\nworkflows, see CI/CD. adacovex is distributed "
       & "as the covex Alire crate, a release bundle on\\nGitHub, or a source build. A"
       & "ll three routes produce the same binary\\n( adacovex, with a covex alias on "
       & "Linux)."",""breadcrumbs"":""Installing adacovex "
