       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Quick start"",""id"":""6"",""title"":""Quick start""},""60"":{""body"":""Start here. The "
       & "Robustness tier (S / A / B / C / D) is a single letter that\\nsummarises fiv"
       & "e quality axes: Docs, Proof, Tests, Compliance, and Deps. An S\\nmeans the p"
       & "roject is healthy across the board. A D means one or more axes\\nare below 5"
       & "0%. Below that: SPARK radar "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " proved verification conditions per check category (flow,\\ninitialization, "
       & "runtime, assertions, functional). A balanced polygon means\\nevery category "
       & "has strong coverage. A spike in one corner and a flat line in\\nanother mean"
       & "s the proof effort is uneven. Tests donut "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " passed vs failed tests. A full green arc means 100%\\npassing. Any red slic"
       & "e means the test suite has failures that must be fixed\\nbefore the project "
       & "can be assessed as Achieved. Doc coverage donut "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " documented subprograms as a percentage of\\ntotal. Strict mode requires 100"
       & "%. A shortfall here shows exactly how many\\nsubprograms are missing -- docs"
       & "trings. Dependency scope ring "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the resolved graph broken down by scope\\n(base / dev / transitive / vendor"
       & "ed / system / test). It sits in the\\nsame row as the doc-coverage donut so "
       & "the Overview uses its width well.\\nEach coloured segment is hoverable: hove"
       & "ring shows the scope name and\\nits component count (for example test: 3). P"
       & "roof check bars scale with the category"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s magnitude, the same way as the\\ntest-category bars: a 407-VC category rea"
       & "ds as a longer bar than a 56-VC\\none, so relative proof effort is visible a"
       & "t a glance."",""breadcrumbs"":""Web dashboard and JSON API "
