       & "urn Adacovex.Types.Dashboard_Theme [Global]""},""649"":{""body"":""Version-control"
       & "-system abstraction for differential modes.\\n"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "compare-base and "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "coverage-delta need a snapshot of a base revision\\nwithout disturbing the w"
       & "orking tree. Legacy codebases can live in\\nMercurial, Subversion, Fossil, o"
       & "r jj rather than git. The snapshot\\noperations are dispatched per VCS here:"
       & " git - git worktree add --detach in a linked worktree\\nhg - hg archive -r R"
       & "EF DIR (pure export, no working-copy change)\\nsvn - svn info --show-item ur"
       & "l + svn export -r REF URL DIR\\nfossil - copy the repo DB and fossil open it"
       & " at REF in a scratch dir\\njj - jj git export into the internal git store, t"
       & "hen a git\\nworktree add against .jj/repo/store/git (jj commits ARE git\\nco"
       & "mmits, and any change or commit id resolves) Detection is marker-file based "
       & "(.git / .jj / .hg / .svn / .fslckout / FOSSIL*), with a command probe fallba"
       & "ck when no marker is present.\\nRuns only on Linux/WSL (uses sh -c for CWD-d"
       & "ependent tools such as\\nfossil).\\nHLR-DIFF: VCS abstraction for differenti"
       & "al assessment See also: VCS support Note: All items in this package are publ"
       & "ic."",""breadcrumbs"":""API reference "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Adacovex.VCS "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
