       & " dependency scope polar ring. Use this to compare SPARK\\nproof, test result"
       & "s, doc coverage, and dependency scope at a glance. See Metrics charts for th"
       & "e full card-by-card breakdown."",""breadcrumbs"":""Web dashboard and JSON API "
