       & " Procedures"",""id"":""669"",""title"":""Procedures""},""67"":{""body"":""Green / full arc"
       & "s "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the metric is at 100% or close to it. Red slices or flat corners "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " there is a regression or missing data. Scope rings "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a large vendored wedge means strict-mode docstrings are\\nbeing suppressed "
       & "by patches. If you see no wedge, vendored code can be\\nuncovered. Tier lett"
       & "er drops "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a drop from A to C means the average across all\\nfive axes fell. Check the"
       & " axis table to see which one regressed. The same data is available headlessl"
       & "y at /api/metrics and via --emit-metrics=PATH ( {\\""metrics\\"":..., \\""depen"
       & "dencies\\"":...}). Path Content GET / HTML dashboard (tabbed) GET /api/metric"
       & "s JSON object with the key assessment metrics GET /api/deps JSON dependency "
       & "graph (same data as the Dependencies tab) GET /api/endpoints JSON endpoint c"
       & "atalog (the list the API playground builds its UI from) GET /docs The bundle"
       & "d offline manual: the mdBook manual built into the binary (HTML, no external"
       & " assets) GET /badge/spark.svg SPARK assurance level badge GET /badge/tests.s"
       & "vg Test pass/fail badge GET /badge/do178c.svg DO-178C compliance badge (Achi"
       & "eved / Unmet) GET /badge/iso26262.svg ISO 26262 compliance badge GET /badge/"
       & "iec62304.svg IEC 62304 compliance badge anything else 404 Not Found The serv"
       & "er runs a small HTTP/1.1 implementation with a 4-worker task pool\\n(configu"
       & "rable with --serve-workers=N, which is a related flag of --serve) and serves"
       & " requests until the process is interrupted (Ctrl-C).\\nQuery strings and URL"
       & " fragments are stripped before routing, so /?theme=light, /api/metrics?x=1 a"
