       & ":""The page is a single self-contained document (no external assets), bundled"
       & "\\ninto the binary from modular resources "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " resources/dashboard.html is\\njust the page skeleton. Author styles and scr"
       & "ipts are split into focused\\nmodules under resources/css/ ( dashboard.css, "
       & "which also styles the\\nhand-rolled donut rings and bar charts) and resource"
       & "s/js/ ( theme.js, tabs.js, deps.js, details.js, nomnoml.js, search.js, api.j"
       & "s).\\nThe vendored libraries ( graphre.js / nomnoml.js / flexsearch.js / yac"
       & "e.js) sit at resources/, clearly separate from the authored js/\\nmodules so"
       & " a scan of the tree can tell dependency JavaScript from dashboard\\nJavaScri"
       & "pt at a glance; they are inlined into the template at build time by tools/ge"
       & "n-dashboard.py, which also minifies the author CSS/JS\\n(comments and whites"
       & "pace stripped, vendored files are inlined byte-for-byte\\nso their tokenizer"
       & " regexes stay intact). The resulting adacovex binary - whether a GitHub rele"
       & "ase artifact or an\\nAlire crate binary - is completely self-contained. The "
       & "dashboard has no\\nexternal asset references and works offline. Edit the ind"
       & "ividual resources/ files, never the\\ngenerated src/adacovex-dashboard_templ"
       & "ate.ads "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the template is regenerated\\nfrom them at build time and a drift-check fai"
       & "ls when it is stale (the developer guide documents that contributor workflow"
       & ").\\nContent is organised into clickable tabs (hash-routed,\\nkeyboard-acces"
       & "sible, persisted in localStorage): Overview "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " status badges (live /badge/*.svg preview), source overview\\n(packages scan"
       & "ned, subprograms, docstring %), and quick stats (SPARK level,\\nVCs proved, "
       & "tests, compliance, dependency count), plus the at-a-glance\\ncollation chart"
       & "s below the stats: a Robustness radar with a tier rating\\n(S/A/B/C/D from t"
       & "he average of five quality axes), the per-check-type SPARK radar, a tests do"
       & "nut and a doc-coverage radial gauge. The\\nbadge row doubles as a preview fo"
       & "r the generated docs/badges/*.svg files.\\nSee Robustness tier for how the r"
       & "ating is derived. Proof "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the SPARK level (Stone..Platinum) and, per check category\\n(flow, initiali"
       & "zation, runtime, assertions, functional), total and proved\\ncounts plus a m"
       & "ini VCs proved/total column at the top of the tab. Tests "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " every test category with count and Pass/Fail plus a mini pass/fail donut at"
       & " the top of the tab. Compliance "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a mini achievement radial gauge at the top, then the\\ntarget integrity lev"
       & "el and overall Achieved / Unmet\\nstatus, HLRs traced, orphan-tag state, whe"
       & "ther tests pass, each unmet\\ncriterion, and the HLR traceability table (pac"
       & "kage -> tags). Dependencies "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a scope-distribution stacked bar at the top, then\\nan interactive dependen"
       & "cy tree/graph (see below). Charts "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " hand-rolled metrics charts, a strict superset of the\\nOverview charts (it "
       & "includes the Robustness tier radar and the SPARK\\nproof-by-check-type radar"
       & ", see below). API "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " an interactive REST API playground: every endpoint the server\\ndispatches "
       & "on as a clickable, searchable button grouped by purpose, with\\na pretty-pri"
       & "nted, yace-syntax-highlighted JSON preview plus Copy and\\nDownload actions "
       & "(see below). Credits "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " third-party libraries used by the dashboard (nomnoml,\\ngraphre, FlexSearch"
       & ", yace, Charts.css) with versions, licences, links and\\nthe THIRD_PARTY_NOT"
       & "ICES pointer. The Playwright row (e2e test tooling) is\\nlabelled test: the "
       & "e2e fixture declares @playwright/test under devDependencies, and adacovex cl"
       & "assifies test-named npm packages (such\\nas @playwright/test) as test depend"
       & "encies. Charts.css is credited as\\ninspiration "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the dashboard charts are adacovex"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own patched version,\\nnot the vendored framework. Tabs are linkable: http"
       & "://localhost:8080/#deps opens the Dependencies tab\\ndirectly (also ?theme=l"
       & "ight#proof composes with the theme pin). The active\\ntab is saved as adacov"
       & "ex-tab in localStorage. The page footer carries a "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Generated by adacovex"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " line with two obvious\\nlinks: Documentation (offline manual) at /docs (the"
       & " bundled mdBook\\nmanual) and Explore the API (jumps to the API playground t"
       & "ab). The raw /api/* URIs are deliberately not listed in the footer "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the API playground\\nis the single place to discover and exercise every end"
       & "point (see API playground)."",""breadcrumbs"":""Web dashboard and JSON API "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
