       & "\ngnatprove = \\""^16.1.0\\"" Then alr build produces bin/adacovex inside the "
       & "project. covex prove\\ndeploys the pinned gnatprove crate standalone via alr"
       & " -n get and runs it\\ndirectly. Each project pins its own exact toolchain ve"
       & "rsion. No global install\\nis needed: alr build\\n./bin/adacovex --target=. "
