       & "title"":""C1: Manual is now an mdBook project with a Read the Docs site""},""715"
       & """:{""body"":""The --serve server now serves a bundled offline manual at /docs ("
       & "both\\nspellings, with and without the trailing slash, reach the same page)."
       & " tools/gen-docs.py runs mdbook build over docs/ at build time, inlines\\nthe"
