       & "nto the binary as src/adacovex-docs_template.ads (regenerated by make book, "
       & "which is also part of make build). Stylesheets are inlined and\\nexternal fo"
       & "nts and interactive scripts are dropped, so the page reads fully\\noffline w"
       & "ith no network or extra assets. The dashboard footer Manual link\\nand the A"
       & "PI playground"
