       & """:{""body"":""The bundled manual served at /docs is searchable offline with mdB"
       & "ook"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s\\nown search. In 1.38 the mdBook search machinery was dropped from the bun"
       & "dle\\n(mdbook"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s elasticlunr search index is a multi-MB single blob that would\\noverflow t"
       & "he gnatprove frontend as one Ada string constant) and the search\\nbox was h"
       & "idden, so the manual in the binary had no search. tools/gen-docs.py\\nnow bu"
       & "ndles the whole mdBook search stack "
