       & " search index is now committed with the rest of docs/book so the\\nbundle st"
       & "ays deterministic. No parallel search index or widget: the search\\nbutton r"
       & "uns mdbook"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own code against mdbook"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own index, exactly like the\\nonline site."",""breadcrumbs"":""Changelogs "
