       & "body"":""The manual pages now live in folders that mirror their audience, so t"
       & "he\\nnavigation shows the structure at a glance: docs/usage/ holds the\\nend"
       & "-user guides (installation, CLI reference, dashboard, SBOM, standards,\\npla"
       & "tforms, VCS, CI/CD, target projects), docs/contributing/ holds the\\ncontrib"
       & "utor and maintainer guides (developer guide, proving, architecture,\\nrequir"
       & "ements, performance, STE100, LLM usage), and the top level keeps the\\nindex"
       & " plus the maintainer references (HLR/LLR, test report, credits,\\nthird-part"
       & "y notices) next to the proof/, compliance/, badges/, api-docs/, and changelo"
       & "gs/ outputs. docs/SUMMARY.md groups the TOC\\ninto Getting started / Using a"
       & "dacovex / Contributing / Maintainer\\nreferences, and every cross-link, READ"
       & "ME link, AGENTS.md doc-links entry, tools/doc-links.map, tools/rst2md.py gui"
