       & "t instructions;\\nthose moved to the developer guide ( docs/contributing/dev"
       & "eloper-guide.md)\\nso end-user pages stay focused on using adacovex."",""bread"
       & "crumbs"":""Changelogs "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.38.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " C10: Docs reorganised into audience folders"",""id"":""723"",""title"":""C10: Docs "
       & "reorganised into audience folders""},""724"":{""body"":""End-user pages no longer "
       & "reference make/dev targets: ci-cd.md scopes make action-parity-check, make c"
       & "overage-gate, make release, and the\\nrelease workflow to the developer guid"
