       & " adacovex 1.36.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Fixes"",""id"":""754"",""title"":""Fixes""},""755"":{""body"":""The dashboard builder min"
       & "ified the authored JavaScript with a comment\\nstripper that did not underst"
       & "and regular-expression literals. A slash pair\\ninside a regular expression,"
       & " for example the // in /^https?:\\\\/\\\\//i, was\\nread as a line comment. "
       & "The stripper then deleted the rest of that line. The deleted text was the de"
       & "pendency link check in details.js: if (d.website && /^https?:\\\\/\\\\//i.te"
       & "st(String(d.website))) { The minifier rewrote it to if (d.website && /^https"
       & "?:\\\\/, an unterminated\\nstatement that broke the dependency detail panel."
       & " The fault lived in the\\ngenerated src/adacovex-dashboard_template.ads, so "
       & "every built binary\\ncarried the broken page. Releases on GitHub and the Ali"
       & "re crate were both\\naffected, because the dashboard is bundled into the bin"
       & "ary as one string\\nconstant. tools/gen-dashboard.py now scans a regular exp"
       & "ression literal to its\\nclosing slash before it strips comments. The previo"
       & "us significant token\\ndecides whether a slash opens a regular expression or"
       & " a division, so\\nembedded // and /* text stays intact. The vendored graph l"
