       & "heck-docs.py (wired as make docs-check) fails when any paragraph\\nin the us"
       & "er documentation, README, or human changelogs exceeds four\\nsentences. It a"
       & "lso rejects em dashes and Latin abbreviations ( i.e., e.g., etc.) to keep th"
       & "e prose under Simplified Technical English. tools/para-split.py rewraps over"
       & "-long paragraphs to comply. The generated docs/api-docs pages are excluded; "
