       & " C3: Four-sentence paragraph gate for hand-written docs"",""id"":""768"",""title"":"
       & """C3: Four-sentence paragraph gate for hand-written docs""},""769"":{""body"":""--t"
       & "z / --timezone override the display zone for status reports.\\nAccepted form"
       & "s are an IANA name ( Asia/Singapore) or a fixed UTC/ GMT offset ( UTC+8, GMT"
       & "+8, UTC+08, GMT+08, UTC+08:30). With\\nno override, adacovex now honours the"
       & " operating system"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s wall-clock zone\\nthrough Ada.Calendar.Time_Zones.UTC_Time_Offset (which r"
       & "eads the TZ\\nvariable and the system timezone) and shows it as UTC+/-HH:MM."
       & " A named\\nzone resolves from a built-in table of common IANA names; a zone "
       & "that may\\nobserve daylight saving time, or one the table lacks, is probed a"
       & "gainst the\\nplatform tzdata ( zdump + date +%z) for the DST-correct current"
       & " offset,\\nwith the table as the fallback when the probe is unavailable. sta"
       & "tus, status --export and status --metrics report the resolved zone, the\\ncu"
       & "rrent date and time, and the count of dated release changelogs under the\\nt"
       & "arget."",""breadcrumbs"":""Changelogs "
       & Character'Val(194)
