       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " C4: Timezone support with OS-aware default"",""id"":""769"",""title"":""C4: Timezon"
       & "e support with OS-aware default""},""77"":{""body"":""Flag Default Description --s"
       & "erve off Run the pipeline, then spawn the HTTP dashboard server (blocking) o"
       & "n the port. It is a switch: passing --serve is the only way to start the ser"
       & "ver, and omitting it (the default, off) renders and exits without serving. T"
       & "here is no --no-serve, because a flag already controls it --port=N 8080 Serv"
       & "er port (a valid Positive integer) --serve-workers=N 4 HTTP server task-pool"
       & " worker count for --serve (a valid Positive integer, capped at 256). Only re"
