       & " C1: Overview paired cards now fill 50-50"",""id"":""781"",""title"":""C1: Overview "
       & "paired cards now fill 50-50""},""782"":{""body"":""The header search indexed each "
       & "tab as one blob of words, so a query only ever\\njumped to a whole tab and m"
