       & " plus one catch-all entry per tab. Queries are tokenised and every token mus"
       & "t match (AND semantics), so multi-word\\npage content and section headings r"
       & "esolve. Selecting a hit switches to the tab and scrolls to the matched secti"
       & "on, briefly flashing it to show where the\\nmatch is, instead of only switch"
       & "ing tabs. Dependency names, versions, scopes,\\nlicences and PURLs stay inde"
       & "xed, so the box still filters the dependency tree."",""breadcrumbs"":""Changelog"
