       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " unlike the test-category bars, which scale because their\\nfill is measured"
       & " against the largest category. The proof fills are now also\\nmeasured again"
       & "st the largest category: the green fill is Proved/Max and the red\\nremainde"
       & "r is (Checks-Proved)/Max inside a full-width track, with the grey track\\nsh"
       & "owing the scale gap "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " so a 407-VC category reads as a longer bar than a\\n56-VC one, precisely li"
