       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.34.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " H1: Proof Check Types bars now scale with value"",""id"":""786"",""title"":""H1: Pr"
       & "oof Check Types bars now scale with value""},""787"":{""body"":""Links outside the"
       & " Credits and footer areas "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the dependency-detail source\\nlink, the /api/deps / /api/metrics reference"
       & "s, and the nomnoml note "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " fell\\nback to the browser"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s default blue/purple, while the Credits and footer links\\nused --accent. A"
