       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.34.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " H2: Links render in the accent colour"",""id"":""787"",""title"":""H2: Links render"
       & " in the accent colour""},""788"":{""body"":""Native suite grows to 1066 tests (14 "
       & "categories). The HTML/Markdown renderer\\nsuite gains two assertions: the pr"
       & "oof-check-type bar scales against the largest\\ncategory (Flow"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s green fill is a quarter of the full-width track when Flow is 2\\nof 8 runt"
       & "ime checks, and the largest category fills it), and the partial-proof\\nred "
       & "remainder is sized by the maximum category. The existing donut,\\nchart-pair"
       & " and hoverable scope-ring checks still pass unchanged."",""breadcrumbs"":""Chang"
       & "elogs "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.34.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Test Suite"",""id"":""788"",""title"":""Test Suite""},""789"":{""body"":""Platinum, 723/7"
       & "23 VCs proved across 50 analysed units (unchanged at 1.34.0 "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "\\nthe renderer and manifest-parser bodies are not in SPARK_Mode On, so the "
       & "bar\\nscaling and cache-key changes add no new VCs). Invocation: adacovex pr"
       & "ove\\n( --steps=10000, gnatprove 16.1.0). 0 unproved, 0 justified."",""breadcr"
       & "umbs"":""Changelogs "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.34.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Proof Results"",""id"":""789"",""title"":""Proof Results""},""79"":{""body"":""A Software"
       & " Bill of Materials (SBOM) is a structured inventory of every\\ncomponent in "
       & "your project, plus its provenance, licence, and (in adacovex"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s\\ncase) its SPARK proof level and compliance context. Generate one in thes"
       & "e\\ncases: Auditing or certifying "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " an SBOM is a standard artifact for safety\\ncertification (DO-178C, ISO 262"
       & "62, IEC 62304). It shows the auditor exactly\\nwhich Ada/Alire components ar"
       & "e in scope and which are proved / not proved. Shifting left on supply-chain "
       & "security "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the dependency graph exposes\\ntransitive dependencies, their licences, and"
       & " their PURLs so you can review\\nthem before a release. Embedding in CI "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the proof-aware SBOM carries the assessed standard and\\nlevel, so downstre"
       & "am tooling (policy engines, compliance dashboards) can\\nconsume it without "
       & "re-parsing markdown reports. Reproducible builds "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " adacovex honours SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH, so the SBOM\\ntimestamp is deterministi"
       & "c when tied to a git commit. adacovex sbom resolves the target project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s dependency graph from its Alire\\nmanifest ( alire.toml / alire-dev.toml),"
       & " the solved-crate list in alire/alire.lock, and the root .gpr with clauses, "
       & "then writes a\\nproof-aware software bill of materials in CycloneDX 1.5 JSON"
       & ", SPDX 2.3 JSON,\\nor Markdown."",""breadcrumbs"":""The sbom subcommand "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " When and why to generate an SBOM"",""id"":""79"",""title"":""When and why to genera"
       & "te an SBOM""},""790"":{""body"":""No new HLRs. Coverage: RENDER-HTML / HLR-DASH "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " C1 paired-card width, C2 section search,\\nH1 proof-bar scaling, H2 uniform"
       & " link colour. MANIFEST / HLR-SBOM "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " C3 self-invalidating system-tool probe cache. HLR-ARCH "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " C4 doc changes (gnatdoc_bin / gnatformat_bin declared as Alire\\ndev depend"
       & "encies in alire-dev.toml and run via alr exec for make doc / make fmt). See "
       & "docs/dashboard.md."",""breadcrumbs"":""Changelogs "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.34.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Traceability"",""id"":""790"",""title"":""Traceability""},""791"":{""body"":""Date: 2026-"
       & "08-28 Version bumped 1.32.0 -> 1.33.0."",""breadcrumbs"":""Changelogs "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.33.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.33.0"",""id"":""791"",""title"":""adacovex 1.33.0""},""792"":{""body"":"""",""br"
       & "eadcrumbs"":""Changelogs "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.33.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Changes"",""id"":""792"",""title"":""Changes""},""793"":{""body"":""A new test dependency"
       & " scope joins base, dev, transitive, vendored\\nand system. A dependency is c"
       & "lassified test when it is used only by the\\nproject"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s tests: a crate declared under a [[test-depends-on]] section of alire.toml "
       & "or alire-dev.toml (the manifest label the parser picks up); or a library wit"
       & "h-claused only from a test project file: a .gpr under a tests/, test/ or t/ "
       & "directory, or a test-named project such as test_runner.gpr. The classificati"
       & "on propagates to everything the test\\nproject pulls in transitively. The sc"
       & "ope is surfaced everywhere the others are: the SBOM adacovex:dep_scope prope"
       & "rty ( \\""test\\""), the dashboard dependency tree\\nbadge, the scope filter c"
       & "heckbox, the scope-stack legend, and the polar\\nrings on the Overview and C"
       & "harts tabs. Collect_GPR_Files now collects .gpr files under tests/, which it"
       & " previously skipped, so test harness\\nprojects resolve as dependencies in t"
       & "he first place."",""breadcrumbs"":""Changelogs "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.33.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " C1: Test-scope dependencies (SBOM and dashboard)"",""id"":""793"",""title"":""C1: T"
       & "est-scope dependencies (SBOM and dashboard)""},""794"":{""body"":""The version pro"
       & "be now runs go version for the go tool (it accepted no\\nflag before, so go "
       & "always reported an empty version). Probing is robust\\nacross tools: the pro"
       & "be tries the tool"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s configured flag first, then falls\\nback through --version, -v and version"
       & ", and takes the first successful\\nrun. fossil and git-lfs keep their versio"
       & "n subcommand; the fallbacks\\ncover any tool whose configured flag fails. Ve"
       & "rsion tokens are cleaned: go version go1.21.5 ... reports 1.21.5 (leading go"
       & " stripped, local\\nbuild tags cut at :), and node --version reports 26.7.0 i"
       & "nstead of v26.7.0. The probe-file and tool-set cache namespaces were salted "
       & "( .v2\\nand |tools-v3|) so stale 1.32 probe results are never served."",""brea"
       & "dcrumbs"":""Changelogs "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.33.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " C2: Robust version probing ( go version, flag fallbacks)"",""id"":""794"",""title"
       & """:""C2: Robust version probing ( go version, flag fallbacks)""},""795"":{""body"":"
       & """alr show prints the release as <crate>=<version>: <description> on the\\nfi"
       & "rst line and the licence under License: "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " not the Version: / Licenses: keys the resolver expected, so manifest-declar"
       & "ed Alire crates\\n(gnatprove, gnatdoc_bin, gnatformat_bin, and any other [[d"
       & "epends-on]])\\nalways reported an empty version and licence. The alire ecosy"
       & "stem row now\\nparses the first-line <crate>=<version> form for the version "
       & "and the License: line for the licence. The adacovex self-SBOM now records gn"
       & "atprove 16.1.0, gnatdoc_bin 26.0.0 and gnatformat_bin 26.0.0 (all dev scope)"
       & " instead of empty versions."",""breadcrumbs"":""Changelogs "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.33.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " C3: Alire dependency versions resolved via alr show"",""id"":""795"",""title"":""C3"
       & ": Alire dependency versions resolved via alr show""},""796"":{""body"":""The parse"
       & "r no longer carries a hard-coded table mapping the bundled\\ndashboard files"
       & " to npm package names and versions (flexsearch 0.7.31,\\nnomnoml 1.7.0, grap"
       & "hre 0.1.3, charts.css 1.2.0). Vendored components are\\nnow discovered from "
       & "the data: the component name is the file"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own base name; the version is read from the file"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own banner comment when it carries one\\n(for example FlexSearch.js v0.7.3"
       & "1 (Bundle)); the licence and website are resolved live from the package regi"
       & "stry under\\nthat same name when the registry knows it (flexsearch, nomnoml,"
       & " graphre);\\nan asset the registry does not know keeps a pkg:generic PURL an"
       & "d no\\nguessed metadata. The authored dashboard modules under resources/css/"
       & " and resources/js/\\nare never componentised: those directories hold the pro"
       & "ject"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own code, not\\nvendored packages. The Credits tab keeps its curated table"
       & " of the bundled\\nlibraries; the SBOM describes what is actually on disk."","""
       & "breadcrumbs"":""Changelogs "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.33.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " C4: Hard-coded vendored-library table removed from the parser"",""id"":""796"","""
       & "title"":""C4: Hard-coded vendored-library table removed from the parser""},""797"
       & """:{""body"":""The header search index was case-sensitive: queries were lowercas"
       & "ed but the\\nfull-text index of each tab"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s rendered content was not, so page text such as\\n"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Orphan Tags"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " (or any HLR tag) could not be found. The index is now folded\\nto lowercase"
       & ", so searching orphan, a package name, or an HLR tag finds the\\ntab that ho"
       & "lds it. Dependency names, versions, scopes, licences and PURLs\\nstay indexe"
       & "d as before."",""breadcrumbs"":""Changelogs "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.33.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " C5: Dashboard search finds page content"",""id"":""797"",""title"":""C5: Dashboard "
       & "search finds page content""},""798"":{""body"":""The nomnoml dependency diagram is"
       & " now rendered as SVG ( nomnoml.renderSvg)\\ninstead of a bitmap canvas. Ever"
       & "y node is real geometry: each box (and its\\nlabel) is clickable with its ex"
       & "act hitbox "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " no manual canvas hit-testing\\nand no zoom-math drift "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " and opens the same split-view detail panel as the\\ntree. The diagram scale"
       & "s with its viewBox, so boxes are never upside\\ndown or clipped, long labels"
       & " no longer overflow their boxes, and a wide\\ngraph scrolls horizontally ins"
       & "ide the card. Hovering a node shows a\\ntooltip with the dependency name and"
       & " version. "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Download SVG"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " now\\nserialises the rendered SVG instead of rasterising the canvas."",""brea"
       & "dcrumbs"":""Changelogs "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.33.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " C6: Dependency diagram rendered as SVG with real clickable nodes"",""id"":""798"
       & """,""title"":""C6: Dependency diagram rendered as SVG with real clickable nodes"""
       & "},""799"":{""body"":""The dashboard"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s metrics charts no longer depend on the vendored Charts.css framework ( res"
       & "ources/charts.min.css\\nand the charts-patch.css overlay are deleted). The C"
       & "redits tab and\\nTHIRD_PARTY_NOTICES still credit Charts.css "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " as inspiration (MIT,\\nnot bundled): the dashboard ships its own patched, h"
       & "and-rolled charts that\\nborrow Charts.css"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s ring-and-segment visual language. All six chart cards\\nare now hand-rolle"
       & "d with plain CSS/SVG, which fixes the rendering problems\\nthe framework int"
       & "roduced: Donuts (SPARK Proof, Tests Pass/Fail, Overview Tests, Overview Doc\"
       & "\nCoverage) are conic-gradient rings with a CSS hole "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the same pattern\\nas the polar ring. The ring colour reflects the covered "
       & "share: fully\\ngreen at 100% (previously every slice resolved to the same gr"
       & "een,\\nso partial coverage never showed red), with green + red segments for\"
       & "\npartial coverage. The centre hole carries the value and caption, and\\nbec"
       & "ause the ring is a fixed-size block (not an absolutely positioned\\ntable ce"
       & "ll) the readout line below never overlaps the chart. Proof Check Types and T"
       & "est Results by Category are flex rows\\nwith a fixed, ellipsising label colu"
       & "mn and a track bar (green proved\\nshare with a red unproved remainder for p"
       & "roof categories). The old\\ncolumn chart rotated its labels with a custom ro"
       & "tate-labels class\\nthat Charts.css does not define, which produced overlapp"
       & "ing label\\nboxes and text overflow; the new rows never rotate and long cate"
       & "gory\\nnames ellipsise instead of overflowing. The Overview tab"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s Tests donut also keeps its readout line\\n( N passed, M failed below the r"
       & "ing), so the pass/fail numbers stay\\nvisible. The charts remain dependency-"
       & "free and follow the theme via CSS\\nvariables."",""breadcrumbs"":""Changelogs "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.33.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " C7: Hand-rolled charts replace the vendored Charts.css"",""id"":""799"",""title"":"
       & """C7: Hand-rolled charts replace the vendored Charts.css""},""8"":{""body"":""alr i"
       & "nstall covex gnatprove\\nexport PATH=\\""$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\\"" covex is t"
       & "he Alire crate name for adacovex\\n( crate page). Once on $PATH, it scans\\n"
       & "the current directory by default. A gnatprove installed this way is picked u"
       & "p\\nfrom $PATH by covex prove when the target project declares no manifest\\"
       & "ndependency of its own."",""breadcrumbs"":""Installing adacovex "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " Option 2: alr install (global, to $PATH)"",""id"":""8"",""title"":""Option 2: alr i"
       & "nstall (global, to $PATH)""},""80"":{""body"":""Choose the format that matches you"
       & "r toolchain: CycloneDX 1.5 JSON ( --format=cyclonedx-json) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " drop into any CycloneDX\\nconsumer (Dependency-Track, OWASP Dependency-Chec"
       & "k, and more). The root\\ncomponent\\ncarries adacovex:proof_level, adacovex:"
       & "standard, adacovex:dal_target,\\nand adacovex:level. Every dependency has a "
       & "language field inferred from\\nfile extensions or declared ecosystems. SPDX "
       & "2.3 JSON ( --format=spdx-json) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " compatible with SPDX-aware tools\\n(FOSSA, Snyk, ScanCode). The adacovex pr"
       & "operties appear as attributionTexts on the root package. Markdown ( --format"
       & "=md) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " human-readable table, useful for audits and\\nreports. Default path is <tar"
       & "get>/docs/compliance/SBOM.md."",""breadcrumbs"":""The sbom subcommand "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " How to read the output"",""id"":""80"",""title"":""How to read the output""},""800"":{"
       & """body"":""The single authored dashboard.js and dashboard.css are split into\\n"
       & "per-concern modules under resources/js/ (theme, tabs, deps, details,\\nnomno"
       & "ml diagram, search) and resources/css/ (base styles including the\\nhand-rol"
       & "led donut/bar chart styles). The page shell inlines each module\\nat its own"
       & " placeholder; tools/gen-dashboard.py bundles them in\\ndependency order (ven"
       & "dored libraries first, then authored modules)."",""breadcrumbs"":""Changelogs "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.33.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " C8: Dashboard HTML/CSS/JS modularised"",""id"":""800"",""title"":""C8: Dashboard HT"
       & "ML/CSS/JS modularised""},""801"":{""body"":""C1 classifies test scope from Alire m"
       & "anifests and test project files.\\nVendored components (packages under node_"
       & "modules, vendor/, and the\\nother vendored roots) are now classified test th"
       & "e same way, across every\\nsupported ecosystem: Section labels: package.json"
       & " sections whose key contains test\\n(for example testDependencies or devTest"
       & "Dependencies), Cargo"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s [dev-dependencies] (Cargo"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s native test-only section) plus any\\nsection containing test, composer"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
