       & " Language detection"",""id"":""87"",""title"":""Language detection""},""870"":{""body"":"""
       & "The Adacovex.Complexity package was probed as a candidate for moving to\\nSP"
       & "ARK-approved (formal) containers so its SPARK_Mode (Off) could be\\nremoved."
       & " Scratch units under gnatprove 16.1.0 show this is not viable: The GNAT 16.2"
       & ".1 runtime formal containers\\n( Ada. Containers. Formal_Vectors and friends"
       & ") are pragma Compile_Time_Error stubs; the implementations moved to the SPAR"
       & "K library shipped inside the gnatprove toolchain (`SPARK. Containers. Formal"
       & ".*`). Adopting them would make the crate depend at build time on the SPARK\\"
       & "nlibrary, breaking the zero-dependency contract: gnatprove is resolved at\\n"
       & "run time by the prove subcommand, but the containers would be a\\ncompile-ti"
       & "me dependency. The Complexity aggregates embed vector components; the formal"
       & "\\ncontainers"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & " limited private Vector cannot be a record component, so a\\ncursor-iteratio"
       & "n data-flow rewrite would be required on top of the\\nlibrary change. Verdic"
       & "t recorded in docs/proof/16.1.0-ledger.md: Adacovex. Complexity and Adacovex"
       & ". Types. Implementation remain the only two SPARK_Mode (Off) packages, both "
       & "for the same reason (non-formal `Ada. Containers instantiations), andspark-o"
       & "ff-check` allows exactly these two."",""breadcrumbs"":""Changelogs "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " adacovex 1.28.0 "
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(187)
       & " C4: Formal-containers experiment confirms the two SPARK_Mode Off exceptions"
       & """,""id"":""870"",""title"":""C4: Formal-containers experiment confirms the two SPAR"
       & "K_Mode Off exceptions""},""871"":{""body"":""Several make targets formatted or par"
