       & "890"":{""body"":""Discover_System_Dev_Deps matched every line against every syst"
       & "em tool with a per-tool substring loop (60 tools x line length). It dominate"
       & "s the whole warm assessment pipeline: profiling showed 76% of warm-path CPU "
       & "in Line_Refers_To / Match_At. The replacement walks each line once, extracts"
       & " maximal [a-z0-9_-] words, and compares each word against the tool table by "
       & "length first. Match semantics are identical and the cmp is per-word, so make"
       & " still matches in make build, Makefile still does not match (capital M), and"
       & " python still does not match in python3. Warm self-assessment dropped from ~"
       & "1021 ms to ~63 ms (16x) on the benchmark machine."",""breadcrumbs"":""Changelogs"
