       & ASCII.LF
       & "                        <h1 id=""web-dashboard-and-json-api""><a class=""header"
       & """ href=""#web-dashboard-and-json-api"">Web dashboard and JSON API</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>adacovex --target=. --serve --port=8080</code> runs the full assess"
       & "ment and then"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "starts a built-in HTTP/1.1 server (no external web stack) that serves a"
