       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""how-to-use-the-dashboard""><a class=""header"" href=""#how-to-use-the-da"
       & "shboard"">How to use the dashboard</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Open <code>http://localhost:8080</code> in a browser. The page is a singl"
       & "e self-contained"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "document (no external assets) with hash-routed tabs. Use the header dropdown"
       & " to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "switch themes (light / dark / system) and <strong>Save settings</strong> to "
       & "persist your"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "choice.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""overview-tab""><a class=""header"" href=""#overview-tab"">Overview tab</a"
       & "></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><label class=""checkbox-label""><input class=""checkbox-img"" type=""checkbox"""
       & "><img src=""../media/dashboard_preview_overview.png"" alt=""Preview of Overview"
       & " tab""><span class=""img-wrapper""><img src=""../media/dashboard_preview_overvie"
       & "w.png"" alt=""Preview of Overview tab""></span></label></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Start here. The <strong>Robustness tier</strong> (S / A / B / C / D) is a"
       & " single letter that"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "summarises five quality axes: Docs, Proof, Tests, Compliance, and Deps. An <"
       & "strong>S</strong>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "means the project is healthy across the board. A <strong>D</strong> means on"
       & "e or more axes"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "are below 50%. Below that:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>SPARK radar</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " proved verification conditions per check category (flow,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "initialization, runtime, assertions, functional). A balanced polygon means"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "every category has strong coverage. A spike in one corner and a flat line in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "another means the proof effort is uneven.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Tests donut</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " passed vs failed tests. A full green arc means 100%"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "passing. Any red slice means the test suite has failures that must be fixed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "before the project can be assessed as <code>Achieved</code>.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Doc coverage donut</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " documented subprograms as a percentage of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "total. Strict mode requires 100%. A shortfall here shows exactly how many"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "subprograms are missing <code>--</code> docstrings.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Dependency scope ring</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the resolved graph broken down by scope"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(base / dev / transitive / vendored / system / test).  It sits in the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "same row as the doc-coverage donut so the Overview uses its width well."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Each coloured segment is hoverable: hovering shows the scope name and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "its component count (for example <code>test: 3</code>).</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Proof check bars scale with the category"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s magnitude, the same way as the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "test-category bars: a 407-VC category reads as a longer bar than a 56-VC"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "one, so relative proof effort is visible at a glance.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""proof-tab""><a class=""header"" href=""#proof-tab"">Proof tab</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><label class=""checkbox-label""><input class=""checkbox-img"" type=""checkbox"""
       & "><img src=""../media/dashboard_preview_proof.png"" alt=""Preview of Proof tab"">"
       & "<span class=""img-wrapper""><img src=""../media/dashboard_preview_proof.png"" al"
       & "t=""Preview of Proof tab""></span></label></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Shows the SPARK level (Stone .. Platinum) and per-category VC counts. The"
       & " mini <strong>VCs proved / total</strong> at the top is the headline number."
       & " Click into a category to see the breakdown.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>If a category is low, that is where the proof effort must focus.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""tests-tab""><a class=""header"" href=""#tests-tab"">Tests tab</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><label class=""checkbox-label""><input class=""checkbox-img"" type=""checkbox"""
       & "><img src=""../media/dashboard_preview_tests.png"" alt=""Preview of Tests tab"">"
       & "<span class=""img-wrapper""><img src=""../media/dashboard_preview_tests.png"" al"
       & "t=""Preview of Tests tab""></span></label></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Every test category with its count and Pass / Fail. A single failing cate"
       & "gory"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "is enough to fail the compliance gate (<code>Tests passing</code> must be <c"
       & "ode>Yes</code> for every"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tier except QM / DAL-E).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""compliance-tab""><a class=""header"" href=""#compliance-tab"">Compliance "
       & "tab</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><label class=""checkbox-label""><input class=""checkbox-img"" type=""checkbox"""
       & "><img src=""../media/dashboard_preview_compliance.png"" alt=""Preview of Compli"
       & "ance tab""><span class=""img-wrapper""><img src=""../media/dashboard_preview_com"
       & "pliance.png"" alt=""Preview of Compliance tab""></span></label></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Shows the target integrity level, overall <code>Achieved</code> / <code>U"
       & "nmet</code>, HLRs traced,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "orphan-tag state, and every unmet criterion. Use this to verify that every H"
       & "LR"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "is tagged in source and that no tags are orphaned (tagged but not defined in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>HLR.md</code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""dependencies-tab""><a class=""header"" href=""#dependencies-tab"">Depende"
       & "ncies tab</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><label class=""checkbox-label""><input class=""checkbox-img"" type=""checkbox"""
       & "><img src=""../media/dashboard_preview_dependencies.png"" alt=""Preview of Depe"
       & "ndencies tab""><span class=""img-wrapper""><img src=""../media/dashboard_preview"
       & "_dependencies.png"" alt=""Preview of Dependencies tab""></span></label></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>An interactive dependency tree (or diagram) of every component in the gra"
       & "ph. Use the filter input and scope checkboxes to focus on base, dev, transit"
       & "ive, vendored, or system dependencies. Click a node to see its licence, PURL"
       & ", parent, and a registry link. Use this tab to audit your supply chain: conf"
       & "irm every vendored licence is compatible, see which system tools the build n"
       & "eeds (the <code>system</code> scope), and trace each component back to its s"
       & "ource.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The diagram view (toggle <strong>Tree / Diagram</strong>) renders the sam"
       & "e graph as a directed diagram.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""charts-tab""><a class=""header"" href=""#charts-tab"">Charts tab</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><label class=""checkbox-label""><input class=""checkbox-img"" type=""checkbox"""
       & "><img src=""../media/dashboard_preview_charts.png"" alt=""Preview of Charts tab"
       & """><span class=""img-wrapper""><img src=""../media/dashboard_preview_charts.png"""
       & " alt=""Preview of Charts tab""></span></label></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Eight CSS-only cards show the same data as the Overview tab in a differen"
       & "t"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "format: the two shared radars (Robustness and SPARK Proof by Check Type),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proof and test donuts, proof and test bar charts, the docstring radial"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gauge, and the dependency scope polar ring. Use this to compare SPARK"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proof, test results, doc coverage, and dependency scope at a glance. See"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a href=""#metrics-charts"">Metrics charts</a> for the full card-by-card break"
       & "down.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""api-tab""><a class=""header"" href=""#api-tab"">API tab</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><label class=""checkbox-label""><input class=""checkbox-img"" type=""checkbox"""
       & "><img src=""../media/dashboard_preview_api.png"" alt=""Preview of API tab""><spa"
       & "n class=""img-wrapper""><img src=""../media/dashboard_preview_api.png"" alt=""Pre"
       & "view of API tab""></span></label></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>An interactive REST API playground: every endpoint the server dispatches "
       & "on"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "as a searchable, clickable button, with a pretty-printed, syntax-highlighted"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "JSON preview. The first endpoint (<code>/api/metrics</code>) runs automatica"
       & "lly, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the tab opens with a live preview. See <a href=""#api-playground"">API playgro"
       & "und</a>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "for the full detail.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""interpreting-the-charts""><a class=""header"" href=""#interpreting-the-c"
       & "harts"">Interpreting the charts</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Green / full arcs</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the metric is at 100% or close to it.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Red slices or flat corners</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " there is a regression or missing data.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Scope rings</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a large vendored wedge means strict-mode docstrings are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "being suppressed by patches. If you see no wedge, vendored code can be"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "uncovered.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Tier letter drops</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a drop from <code>A</code> to <code>C</code> means the average across all"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "five axes fell. Check the axis table to see which one regressed.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The same data is available headlessly at <code>/api/metrics</code> and vi"
       & "a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--emit-metrics=PATH</code> (<code>{""metrics"":..., ""dependencies"":...}<"
