       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The server runs a small HTTP/1.1 implementation with a 4-worker task pool"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(configurable with <code>--serve-workers=N</code>, which is a related flag o"
       & "f"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--serve</code>) and serves requests until the process is interrupted ("
       & "Ctrl-C)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Query strings and URL fragments are stripped before routing, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>/?theme=light</code>, <code>/api/metrics?x=1</code> and <code>/api/dep"
       & "s#top</code> reach the same"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "handlers as <code>/</code>, <code>/api/metrics</code> and <code>/api/deps</c"
       & "ode> instead of 404ing.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""bundled-offline-manual""><a class=""header"" href=""#bundled-offline-man"
       & "ual"">Bundled offline manual</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code>--serve</code> server also serves the <strong>bundled offline m"
       & "anual</strong> at <code>/docs</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(both spellings, with and without the trailing slash, reach the same page)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The manual is the same Markdown source that powers the Read the Docs site"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>docs/</code>, an mdBook project with <code>book.toml</code> and <code"
       & ">SUMMARY.md</code>); at build"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "time <code>tools/gen-docs.py</code> runs <code>mdbook build</code> and bundl"
       & "es the resulting site"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "into the binary (<code>src/adacovex-docs_template.ads</code>) as a lookup ta"
       & "ble plus"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "static string constants: every page, stylesheet, script, and badge, keyed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "by book-relative path, so the manual is fully self-contained and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "navigable offline (each constant stays small "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a single multi-megabyte"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "blob would overflow the gnatprove frontend stack, so the search index is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "split into chunks and the server streams them). mdBook"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own search"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "machinery (elasticlunr, mark, searcher, and the search index) is bundled"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the search button works exactly as on the online site. External fonts"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the PNG screenshots are dropped (the screenshots show as notes), and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the bundled HTML stays pure ASCII (non-ASCII glyphs are encoded as UTF-8"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "byte values in the Ada source).  Users on a machine without a network"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "connection can still open the manual from the dashboard "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the header"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<strong>Documentation (offline manual)</strong> link and the API playground"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code>/docs</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "endpoint both point at it.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""the-html-dashboard""><a class=""header"" href=""#the-html-dashboard"">The"
       & " HTML dashboard</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The page is a single self-contained document (no external assets), bundle"
       & "d"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "into the binary from <strong>modular resources</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code>resources/dashboard.html</code> is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "just the page skeleton. Author styles and scripts are split into focused"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "modules under <code>resources/css/</code> (<code>dashboard.css</code>, which"
       & " also styles the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "hand-rolled donut rings and bar charts) and <code>resources/js/</code> (<cod"
       & "e>theme.js</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>tabs.js</code>, <code>deps.js</code>, <code>details.js</code>, <code>n"
       & "omnoml.js</code>, <code>search.js</code>, <code>api.js</code>)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The vendored libraries (<code>graphre.js</code> / <code>nomnoml.js</code> / "
       & "<code>flexsearch.js</code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>yace.js</code>) sit at <code>resources/</code>, clearly separate from "
       & "the authored <code>js/</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "modules so a scan of the tree can tell dependency JavaScript from dashboard"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "JavaScript at a glance; they are inlined into the template at build time by"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>tools/gen-dashboard.py</code>, which also <strong>minifies</strong> th"
       & "e author CSS/JS"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(comments and whitespace stripped, vendored files are inlined byte-for-byte"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "so their tokenizer regexes stay intact).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The resulting <code>adacovex</code> binary - whether a GitHub release art"
       & "ifact or an"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Alire crate binary - is completely self-contained. The dashboard has no"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "external asset references and works offline.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Edit the individual <code>resources/</code> files, never the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "generated <code>src/adacovex-dashboard_template.ads</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the template is regenerated"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "from them at build time and a drift-check fails when it is stale (the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a href=""../contributing/developer-guide.html"">developer guide</a> documents"
       & " that contributor workflow)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Content is organised into <strong>clickable tabs</strong> (hash-routed,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "keyboard-accessible, persisted in <code>localStorage</code>):</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Overview</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " status badges (live <code>/badge/*.svg</code> preview), source overview"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(packages scanned, subprograms, docstring %), and quick stats (SPARK level,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "VCs proved, tests, compliance, dependency count), plus the at-a-glance"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "collation charts below the stats: a <strong>Robustness radar with a tier rat"
       & "ing</strong>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(S/A/B/C/D from the average of five quality axes), the per-check-type"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<strong>SPARK radar</strong>, a tests <strong>donut</strong> and a doc-cover"
